нструментария для проектов на TypeScript, Rust и Python","ar":"يعتبر init-local-tooling أداة إعداد لأدوات المشاريع المحلية باللغات TypeScript و Rust و Python، حيث يوفر ميزات التلدين والتدوين والاختبارات"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"init-local-tooling: Comprehensive Setup Guide for AI Agents","zh":"init-local-tooling 设置指南：TypeScript、Rust 和 Python 项目工具初始化","ja":"init-local-tooling セットアップガイド：TypeScript、Rust、Python プロジェク...","ko":"init-local-tooling 설정 가이드: TypeScript, Rust, Python 프로젝트 ...","es":"Guía de configuración de init-local-tooling para proyecto...","fr":"Guide de mise en place d''init-local-tooling pour les proj...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für init-local-tooling in TypeScrip...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do init-local-tooling para Projetos ...","ru":"ИИ Агент init-local-tooling: Настройка локального инструм...","ar":"دليل إعداد init-local-tooling لأدوات المشاريع المحلية بال..."},"description":{"en":"Streamline your development workflow with init-local-tooling. Learn how to set up linting, formatting, and CI/CD for TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects. G...","zh":"使用 init-local-tooling 技能快速设置 TypeScript、Rust 和 Python 项目的 linting、 formatting、类型检查、测试、Git hooks 和 CI/CD","ja":"init-local-tooling スキルを使用して、TypeScript、Rust、Python プロジェクトの linting、formatting、型チェック、テスト、Git Hooks、CI/CD を迅速に設定","ko":"init-local-tooling 스킬을 사용하여 TypeScript, Rust, Python 프로젝트의 linting, formatting, 타입 체크, 테스트, Git hooks, CI/CD를 빠르게 설정","es":"Aprende a configurar el init-local-tooling para proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python con esta guía detallada sobre herramientas de desarrollo y automatización","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer init-local-tooling pour les projets TypeScript, Rust et Python avec ce guide détaillé sur les outils de développement et l''autom...","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie init-local-tooling für TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte konfigurieren, mit diesem detaillierten Leitfaden zu Entwicklungstools un...","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o init-local-tooling para projetos TypeScript, Rust e Python, incluindo linting, formatação e testes","ru":"Настройте локальное инструментарие для проектов на TypeScript, Rust и Python с помощью ИИ Агента init-local-tooling","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد init-local-tooling لأدوات المشاريع المحلية باللغات TypeScript و Rust و Python، بما في ذلك التلدين والتدوين والاختبارات"},"definition":{"en":"init-local-tooling is a skill that initializes and configures local tooling for TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects, including linting, formatting, and CI/CD setup.","zh":"init-local-tooling 是一个 AI 工具，用于初始化 TypeScript、Rust 和 Python 项目的本地工具","ja":"init-local-tooling は、TypeScript、Rust、Python プロジェクトのローカルツールを初期化する AI エージェントです","ko":"init-local-tooling은 TypeScript, Rust, Python 프로젝트의 로컬 툴링을 초기화하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El init-local-tooling es una herramienta de configuración que inicializa y configura herramientas de desarrollo para proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python","fr":"L''init-local-tooling est un outil de configuration qui initialise et configure des outils de développement pour les projets TypeScript, Rust et Python","de":"Das init-local-tooling ist ein Konfigurationswerkzeug, das Entwicklungstools für TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte initialisiert und konfiguriert","pt":"O init-local-tooling é uma ferramenta de configuração que inicializa o instrumentário local para projetos de desenvolvimento","ru":"ИИ Агент init-local-tooling - это инструмент для настройки локального инструментария для проектов разработки","ar":"يعتبر init-local-tooling أداة إعداد لأدوات المشاريع المحلية التي تهيئ الأدوات المحلية للمشاريع التطويرية"},"features":{"en":["Configures Git hooks with lefthook for conventional commits, pre-commit, and pre-push","Sets up GitHub Actions for CI/CD pipelines"," Initializes monorepo with Nx and pnpm workspaces","Adds automated publishing to npm and crates","Supports type checking and testing for TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects","Enables formatting and linting for consistent code quality"],"zh":["TypeScript、Rust 和 Python 项目的 linting 和 formatting","类型检查和测试","Git hooks 配置（包括 conventional commits、pre-commit 和 pre-push）","CI/CD 设置（包括 GitHub Actions）","自动发布到 npm 和 crates.io"],"ja":["TypeScript、Rust、Python プロジェクトの linting と formatting","型チェックとテスト","Git Hooks の設定（conventional commits、pre-commit、pre-push を含む）","CI/CD の設定（GitHub Actions を含む）","npm と crates.io への自動公開"],"ko":["TypeScript, Rust, Python 프로젝트의 linting과 formatting","타입 체크와 테스트","Git hooks 설정（conventional commits, pre-commit, pre-push 포함）","CI/CD 설정（GitHub Actions 포함）","npm과 crates.io로의 자동发布"],"es":["Configuración de herramientas de desarrollo como linting y formateo","Verificación de tipos y pruebas para proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python","Configuración de Git hooks con lefthook para commits convencionales","Integración con GitHub Actions para CI/CD","Publicación automática en npm y crat"],"fr":["Configuration d''outils de développement tels que linting et formatage","Vérification de types et tests pour les projets TypeScript, Rust et Python","Configuration de Git hooks avec lefthook pour les commits conventionnels","Intégration avec GitHub Actions pour CI/CD","Publication automatique sur npm et crat"],"de":["Konfiguration von Entwicklungstools wie Linting und Formatierung","Typüberprüfung und Tests für TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte","Konfiguration von Git-Hooks mit lefthook für konventionelle Commits","Integration mit GitHub Actions für CI/CD","Automatische Veröffentlichung auf npm und crat"],"pt":["Configuração de linting e formatação para TypeScript, Rust e Python","Inicialização de monorepo com Nx + pnpm workspaces","Configuração de hooks do Git com lefthook","Adição de ações do GitHub para CI/CD","Configuração de publicação automática para npm e crat"],"ru":["Настройка linting и форматирования для TypeScript, Rust и Python","Инициализация монорепозитория с Nx + pnpm workspaces","Настройка хуков Git с lefthook","Добавление действий GitHub для CI/CD","Настройка автоматической публикации в npm и crat"],"ar":["إعداد التلدين والتدوين لأدوات المشاريع المحلية باللغات TypeScript و Rust و Python","تهيئة مستودع واحد مع Nx + pnpm workspaces","إعداد-hooks للجيت مع lefthook","إضافة إجراءات جيثب ل CI/CD","إعداد النشر التلقائي إلى npm و crat"]},"keywords":{"en":["init-local-tooling setup guide","how to use init-local-tooling","init-local-tooling vs other tooling","init-local-tooling install","what is init-local-tooling","init-local-tooling alternative","init-local-tooling for TypeScript","init-local-tooling for Rust","init-local-tooling for Python","init-local-tooling and GitHub Actions"],"zh":["init-local-tooling","TypeScript 项目设置","Rust 项目设置","Python 项目设置","linting 和 formatting","类型检查和测试","Git hooks","CI/CD","自动发布"],"ja":["init-local-tooling","TypeScript プロジェクト設定","Rust プロジェクト設定","Python プロジェクト設定","linting と formatting","型チェックとテスト","Git Hooks","CI/CD","自動公開"],"ko":["init-local-tooling","TypeScript 프로젝트 설정","Rust 프로젝트 설정","Python 프로젝트 설정","linting과 formatting","타입 체크와 테스트","Git hooks","CI/CD","자동发布"],"es":["init-local-tooling","herramientas de desarrollo","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","formateo","verificación de tipos","pruebas","Git hooks","GitHub Actions","CI/CD","publicación automática"],"fr":["init-local-tooling","outils de développement","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","formatage","vérification de types","tests","Git hooks","GitHub Actions","CI/CD","publication automatique"],"de":["init-local-tooling","Entwicklungstools","TypeScript","Rust","Python","Linting","Formatierung","Typüberprüfung","Tests","Git-Hooks","GitHub Actions","CI/CD","automatische Veröffentlichung"],"pt":["init-local-tooling","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","formatação","testes","monorepo","Nx","pnpm workspaces","lefhooke","GitHub Actions","CI/CD","npm","crat"],"ru":["ИИ Агент init-local-tooling","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","форматирование","тесты","монорепозиторий","Nx","pnpm workspaces","lefhooke","действия GitHub","CI/CD","npm","crat"],"ar":["init-local-tooling","TypeScript","Rust","Python","التلدين","التدوين","الاختبارات","مستودع واحد","Nx","pnpm workspaces","lefhooke","إجراءات جيثب","CI/CD","npm","crat"]}},"owner":"aaronbassett","repo":"paneful","repoPath":"aaronbassett/paneful","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.314Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"init-local-tooling","description":"Initialize and configure local development tooling for TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects including monorepos. Use when setting up linting (ESLint, Biome, clippy, ruff), formatting (Prettier, rustfmt, ruff), type checking (tsc, mypy), testing (Vitest, Jest, cargo test, pytest), Git hooks (lefthook for commit-msg, pre-commit, pre-push), GitHub Actions workflows, package publishing (npm, crates.io, PyPI), version management (Changesets), and automated releases. Covers both single-language projects and multi-language monorepos using Nx + pnpm workspaces.","bodyPreview":"# Local Tooling Initialization\n\nComprehensive setup for linting, formatting, type checking, testing, Git hooks, CI/CD, and publishing across TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Initialize tooling for a new TypeScript/Rust/Python project\n- Set up monorepo with Nx + pnpm workspaces\n- Configure Git hooks with lefthook (conventional commits, pre-commit, pre-push)\n- Add GitHub Actions for CI/CD\n- Set up automated publishing to npm/crat","body":"# Local Tooling Initialization\n\nComprehensive setup for linting, formatting, type checking, testing, Git hooks, CI/CD, and publishing across TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Initialize tooling for a new TypeScript/Rust/Python project\n- Set up monorepo with Nx + pnpm workspaces\n- Configure Git hooks with lefthook (conventional commits, pre-commit, pre-push)\n- Add GitHub Actions for CI/CD\n- Set up automated publishing to npm/crates.io/PyPI\n- Configure version bumping and changelog generation with Changesets\n- Migrate from Husky to lefthook\n- Choose between ESLint+Prettier vs Biome for TypeScript\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### TypeScript Project\n\n**Automated setup:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh\n```\n\n**Choose tooling:**\n- **Biome** (recommended) - Fast, all-in-one, modern\n- **ESLint + Prettier** - Traditional, highly configurable\n\n**What you get:**\n- Linting and formatting\n- TypeScript strict mode\n- Vitest for testing\n- Package.json scripts\n\n→ **See:** [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n\n### Rust Project\n\n**Manual setup (opinionated configs in assets/):**\n```bash\n# Tools come with Rust\nrustup component add rustfmt clippy\n\n# Optional: Enhanced tooling\nbrew install cargo-nextest cargo-deny\n\n# Copy configs from assets/configs/rust/\ncp assets/configs/rust/rustfmt.toml .\ncp assets/configs/rust/clippy.toml .\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n\n### Python Project\n\n**Using uv (recommended):**\n```bash\n# Install uv\nbrew install uv\n\n# Create project\nuv init my-project\ncd my-project\n\n# Add dev dependencies\nuv add --dev ruff mypy pytest\n\n# Copy config from assets/\ncp assets/configs/python/pyproject.toml .\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n\n### Monorepo Setup\n\n**Create Nx + pnpm monorepo:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_monorepo.sh\n```\n\nOr manually:\n```bash\nnpx create-nx-workspace@latest my-monorepo\n# Choose: pnpm + integrated monorepo\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n### 1. Choose Project Type\n\n**Single Language Project**\n→ Use language-specific init script or manual setup\n→ See Quick Start above\n\n**Monorepo (Multiple Packages)**\n→ Set up Nx + pnpm workspaces\n→ See [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n### 2. Configure Git Hooks\n\n**Automated setup:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\nThis configures:\n- **commit-msg** - Conventional commits validation\n- **pre-commit** - Format and lint staged files\n- **pre-push** - Full validation (lint, type-check, test, build)\n\n→ **See:** [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n\n### 3. Set Up CI/CD\n\n**Copy workflow templates:**\n```bash\n# Basic CI\ncp assets/workflows/ci.yml .github/workflows/\n\n# Language-specific workflows available in assets/\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n\n### 4. Configure Publishing (Optional)\n\n**For npm packages:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\nThen copy publishing workflows from `assets/workflows/`.\n\n→ **See:**\n- [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n- [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md)\n\n---\n\n## Language-Specific Guides\n\n### TypeScript/JavaScript\n\n**Tooling options:**\n- **Biome** - Fast, opinionated, all-in-one (recommended for new projects)\n- **ESLint + Prettier** - Traditional, highly configurable (recommended for existing projects)\n\n**Testing:**\n- **Vitest** - Modern, fast, Vite-based (recommended)\n- **Jest** - Established, widely used\n\n**Key decisions:**\n- Choose Biome for speed and simplicity\n- Choose ESLint+Prettier for existing projects or specific plugins\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n\n### Rust\n\n**Built-in tools:**\n- `rustfmt` - Code formatting\n- `clippy` - Linting\n- `cargo test` - Testing\n\n**Enhanced tools:**\n- `cargo-nextest` - Faster test runner\n- `cargo-deny` - Dependency security\n- `cargo-make` - Task runner\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n\n### Python\n\n**Modern stack (recommended):**\n- **uv** - Fast package manager\n- **ruff** - Fast linting + formatting (replaces black, isort, flake8)\n- **mypy** - Type checking\n- **pytest** - Testing\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n\n---\n\n## Git Hooks with lefthook\n\n### Why lefthook?\n\n- **Language-agnostic** - Works across TS, Rust, Python\n- **Fast** - Parallel execution, written in Go\n- **Simple** - Single YAML config\n- **Better than Husky** - Faster, works across languages\n\n### Setup\n\n**Automated:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Manual:**\n```bash\nbrew install lefthook\nlefthook install\n```\n\n### Configuration Example\n\n**lefthook.yml:**\n```yaml\ncommit-msg:\n  commands:\n    commitlint:\n      run: npx commitlint --edit {1}\n\npre-commit:\n  parallel: true\n  commands:\n    format:\n      glob: \"*.{ts,rs,py}\"\n      run: format-staged-files {staged_files}\n      stage_fixed: true\n\npre-push:\n  commands:\n    validate:\n      run: ./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n\n---\n\n## Monorepo Management\n\n### Nx + pnpm Workspaces\n\n**Key principle:** Nx builds on top of pnpm, doesn''t replace it.\n\n- **pnpm workspaces** - Dependency management\n- **Nx** - Task orchestration, caching, affected commands\n\n### Benefits\n\n- Run tasks only for affected packages\n- Intelligent caching\n- Parallel execution\n- Supports multiple languages\n\n### Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Run target for all packages\nnx run-many --target=build --all\n\n# Run only for affected\nnx affected --target=test\n\n# Visualize dependencies\nnx graph\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n---\n\n## Version Management & Publishing\n\n### Changesets Workflow\n\n**Recommended for monorepos and npm packages.**\n\n1. **Add changeset:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset\n# Select packages, type (major/minor/patch), write summary\n```\n\n2. **Version packages:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset version\n# Updates package.json, generates CHANGELOG.md\n```\n\n3. **Publish:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset publish\ngit push --follow-tags\n```\n\n### Automated Publishing\n\nUse GitHub Actions to automate releases:\n\n**Copy workflow:**\n```bash\ncp assets/workflows/publish-changesets.yml .github/workflows/\n```\n\nThis creates \"Version Packages\" PR on main when changesets exist.\n\n→ **See:**\n- [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n- [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md)\n\n---\n\n## CI/CD Setup\n\n### Match Local Validation\n\n**Best practice:** Run same checks in CI as local pre-push hook.\n\n**GitHub Actions templates:**\n- `ci.yml` - Basic linting, testing, building\n- `publish-npm.yml` - Automated npm publishing\n- `publish-crates.yml` - Automated crates.io publishing\n- `publish-pypi.yml` - Automated PyPI publishing\n\n### Matrix Testing\n\nTest across multiple versions:\n\n```yaml\nstrategy:\n  matrix:\n    node-version: [18, 20, 21]\n    os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest]\n```\n\n### Nx Monorepo CI\n\nUse affected commands to only test changed packages:\n\n```bash\nnx affected --target=test\nnx affected --target=build\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n\n---\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Initialize TypeScript Project\n\n**Automated:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh --biome\n# or\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh --eslint-prettier\n```\n\n**Creates:**\n- tsconfig.json (strict mode)\n- Linting config (biome.json or eslint.config.js)\n- Formatting config (.prettierrc.json if ESLint)\n- Testing config (vitest.config.ts)\n- Package.json scripts\n\n### Set Up Git Hooks\n\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Configures:**\n- Conventional commits validation\n- Pre-commit: lint/format staged files\n- Pre-push: full validation\n\n### Configure Changesets\n\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\n**Sets up:**\n- .changeset/ directory\n- Package.json scripts\n- Public access configuration\n\n### Full Validation\n\n```bash\n./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n**Runs:**\n- Format checking\n- Linting\n- Type checking\n- Tests\n- Builds\n\n---\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n### Scripts (`scripts/`)\n\n**Setup scripts:**\n- `init_typescript.sh` - Initialize TypeScript project\n- `setup_lefthook.sh` - Configure Git hooks\n- `setup_changesets.sh` - Set up version management\n- `validate_all.sh` - Run all checks (used by pre-push)\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n./scripts/script_name.sh\n```\n\nAll scripts check if tools are installed/up-to-date before proceeding.\n\n### Config Templates (`assets/configs/`)\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- `tsconfig.strict.json` - Strict TypeScript config\n- `biome.json` - Biome configuration\n- `eslint.config.js` - ESLint flat config\n- `.prettierrc.json` - Prettier configuration\n\n**Rust:**\n- `rustfmt.toml` - Rustfmt configuration\n- `clippy.toml` - Clippy lints\n- `deny.toml` - Cargo-deny configuration\n\n**Python:**\n- `pyproject.toml` - ruff, mypy, pytest config\n- `ruff.toml` - Standalone ruff config\n\n**Monorepo:**\n- `nx.json` - Nx configuration\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml` - pnpm workspaces\n\n**Git Hooks:**\n- `lefthook.yml` - Complete lefthook config\n- `commitlint.config.js` - Conventional commits\n\n**GitHub Workflows:**\n- `ci.yml` - Basic CI\n- `publish-changesets.yml` - Automated releases\n- `publish-npm.yml` - npm publishing\n- `publish-crates.yml` - crates.io publishing\n- `publish-pypi.yml` - PyPI publishing\n\n### Reference Documentation (`references/`)\n\n**Language guides:**\n- `typescript.md` - ESLint+Prettier vs Biome, testing, monorepo\n- `rust.md` - rustfmt, clippy, cargo-nextest, cargo-deny\n- `python.md` - ruff, mypy, pytest, uv vs poetry\n\n**Infrastructure:**\n- `monorepo.md` - Nx + pnpm workspaces setup\n- `git-hooks.md` - lefthook configuration\n- `ci-cd.md` - GitHub Actions workflows\n- `publishing.md` - npm, crates.io, PyPI publishing\n- `version-management.md` - Changesets workflow\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use lefthook over Husky** - Faster, language-agnostic\n2. **Match CI and local** - Same checks in pre-push and CI\n3. **Choose Biome for new TS projects** - Faster, simpler\n4. **Use Nx affected commands** - Only test changed packages\n5. **Automate versioning** - Use Changesets for npm packages\n6. **Conventional commits** - Enables automated changelogs\n7. **Pre-commit: staged files** - Fast feedback\n8. **Pre-push: full validation** - Catch issues before pushing\n9. **Type-check everything** - TypeScript, mypy, clippy\n10. **Test before publish** - Always run tests in pre-publish\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Hooks Not Running\n\n**Check installation:**\n```bash\nlefthook install\nls -la .git/hooks/\n```\n\n**Test manually:**\n```bash\nlefthook run pre-commit\n```\n\n### Format Conflicts\n\n**ESLint + Prettier conflicts:**\n- Ensure `eslint-config-prettier` is last in config\n- Run Prettier separately from ESLint\n\n**Biome + Prettier conflicts:**\n- Don''t use both - choose one\n- Biome is drop-in Prettier replacement\n\n### CI Failures\n\n**Debugging:**\n1. Run `./scripts/validate_all.sh` locally\n2. Check CI runs same commands\n3. Verify Node/Rust/Python versions match\n4. Check caching is working\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Setup new TypeScript project:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh\n```\n\n**Setup Git hooks:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Setup Changesets:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\n**Run full validation:**\n```bash\n./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n**Common commands:**\n```bash\n# TypeScript\nnpm run lint && npm run type-check && npm test\n\n# Rust\ncargo fmt -- --check && cargo clippy -- -D warnings && cargo test\n\n# Python\nruff check . && mypy . && pytest\n\n# Monorepo\nnx affected --target=test\nnx run-many --target=build --all\n\n# Changesets\npnpm changeset\npnpm changeset version\npnpm changeset publish\n```\n\n---\n\n## Getting Help\n\n- **TypeScript:** See [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n- **Rust:** See [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n- **Python:** See [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n- **Monorepo:** See [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n- **Git Hooks:** See [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n- **CI/CD:** See [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n- **Publishing:** See [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md) and [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:41.485Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing comprehensive local tooling setup for TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects.","zh":"非常适合需要为TypeScript、Rust和Python项目设置综合本地工具的开发代理。","ja":"TypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトの包括的なローカルツール設定が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"TypeScript, Rust 및 Python 프로젝트를 위한 포괄적인 로컬 툴링 설정이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una configuración de herramientas locales integral para proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''une configuration d''outils locaux complète pour les projets TypeScript, Rust et Python.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine umfassende lokale Werkzeugkonfiguration für TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de uma configuração de ferramentas locais abrangente para projetos TypeScript, Rust e Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется всесторонняя настройка локальных инструментов для проектов TypeScript, Rust и Python.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات开发 التي تحتاج إلى إعداد أدوات محلية شاملة لمشاريع TypeScript و Rust و Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows with automated linting, formatting, type checking, testing, and CI/CD using Nx, pnpm workspaces, and GitHub Actions, while also supporting conventional commits and automated publishing to npm/crat.","zh":"赋予代理人员使用Nx、pnpm工作空间和GitHub Actions实现开发工作流的自动化，包括自动linting、格式化、类型检查、测试和CI/CD，并支持传统提交和自动发布到npm/crat。","ja":"Nx、pnpmワークスペース、GitHub Actionsを使用して開発ワークフローの自動化、自動linting、フォーマット、タイプチェック、テスト、CI/CD、および従来のコミットとnpm/cratへの自動公開をサポートすることで、エージェントを強化します。","ko":"Nx, pnpm 작업공간 및 GitHub Actions를 사용하여 개발 워크플로의 자동화, 자동 linting, 형식화, 유형 검사, 테스트 및 CI/CD를 가능하게 하며, 전통적인 커밋 및 npm/crat로의 자동 발행을 지원하여 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con linting automatizado, formato, verificación de tipos, pruebas y CI/CD utilizando Nx, pnpm workspaces y GitHub Actions, y también admite commits convencionales y publicación automatizada en npm/crat.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simplifier les flux de travail de développement avec une mise en forme automatisée, un formatage, une vérification de types, des tests et un CI/CD à l''aide de Nx, pnpm workspaces et GitHub Actions, tout en prenant en charge les commits classiques et la publication automatisée sur npm/crat.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Entwicklungswerkflüsse mit automatisierter Linting, Formatierung, Typüberprüfung, Tests und CI/CD mithilfe von Nx, pnpm workspaces und GitHub Actions zu rationalisieren, während auch konventionelle Commits und automatisierte Veröffentlichung auf npm/crat unterstützt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes racionalizem os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com linting automatizado, formatação, verificação de tipo, teste e CI/CD usando Nx, pnpm workspaces e GitHub Actions, além de suportar commits convencionais e publicação automatizada para npm/crat.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать рабочие процессы разработки за счет автоматизированного linting, форматирования, проверки типов, тестирования и CI/CD с использованием Nx, pnpm workspaces и GitHub Actions, а также поддерживает конвенциональные коммиты и автоматическую публикацию в npm/crat.","ar":"يمكن للعمليات من خلاله تسريع تدفقات العمل التطويرية باستخدام linting وتنسيق وتحقق من النوع واختبار و CI/CD باستخدام Nx و pnpm workspaces و GitHub Actions، بالإضافة إلى دعم الإلتزامات التقليدية والنشر التلقائي إلى npm/crat."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing local tooling for new TypeScript, Rust, or Python projects","Configuring monorepo projects with Nx and pnpm workspaces","Automating testing and CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions"],"zh":["为新的TypeScript、Rust或Python项目初始化本地工具","使用Nx和pnpm工作空间配置monorepo项目","使用GitHub Actions自动化测试和CI/CD管道"],"ja":["新しいTypeScript、Rust、またはPythonプロジェクトのローカルツールの初期化","Nxとpnpmワークスペースを使用したmonorepoプロジェクトの設定","GitHub Actionsを使用したテストとCI/CDパイプラインの自動化"],"ko":["新的 TypeScript, Rust 또는 Python 프로젝트를 위한 로컬 툴 초기화","Nx 및 pnpm 작업공간을 사용한 monorepo 프로젝트 구성","GitHub Actions를 사용한 테스트 및 CI/CD 파이프라인 자동화"],"es":["Inicialización de herramientas locales para nuevos proyectos de TypeScript, Rust o Python","Configuración de proyectos monorepo con Nx y pnpm workspaces","Automatización de pruebas y tuberías de CI/CD con GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Initialisation des outils locaux pour les nouveaux projets TypeScript, Rust ou Python","Configuration des projets monorepo avec Nx et pnpm workspaces","Automatisation des tests et des pipelines de CI/CD avec GitHub Actions"],"de":["Initialisierung der lokalen Werkzeuge für neue TypeScript-, Rust- oder Python-Projekte","Konfiguration von Monorepo-Projekten mit Nx und pnpm workspaces","Automatisierung von Tests und CI/CD-Pipelines mit GitHub Actions"],"pt":["Inicializar as ferramentas locais para novos projetos TypeScript, Rust ou Python","Configurar projetos monorepo com Nx e pnpm workspaces","Automatizar testes e pipelines de CI/CD com GitHub Actions"],"ru":["Инициализировать локальные инструменты для новых проектов TypeScript, Rust или Python","Настроить проекты monorepo с Nx и pnpm workspaces","Автоматизировать тестирование и конвейеры CI/CD с GitHub Actions"],"ar":["تهيئة الأدوات المحلية لمشاريع TypeScript و Rust و Python الجديدة","ضبط مشاريع monorepo باستخدام Nx و pnpm workspaces","تأتمتة الاختبارات وخطوط أنابيب CI/CD باستخدام GitHub Actions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nx and pnpm workspaces for monorepo setup","Limited to TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects","Needs GitHub repository for CI/CD and automated publishing"],"zh":["需要Nx和pnpm工作空间来设置monorepo","仅限于TypeScript、Rust和Python项目","需要GitHub存储库来实现CI/CD和自动发布"],"ja":["monorepoの設定にはNxとpnpmワークスペースが必要","TypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトのみ","CI/CDと自動公開にはGitHubリポジトリが必要"],"ko":["monorepo 설정에는 Nx 및 pnpm 작업공간이 필요","TypeScript, Rust 및 Python 프로젝트만 해당","CI/CD 및 자동 발행에는 GitHub 저장소가 필요"],"es":["Requiere Nx y pnpm workspaces para la configuración de monorepo","Limitado a proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python","Necesita un repositorio de GitHub para CI/CD y publicación automatizada"],"fr":["Nécessite Nx et pnpm workspaces pour la configuration de monorepo","Limité aux projets TypeScript, Rust et Python","Nécessite un référentiel GitHub pour le CI/CD et la publication automatisée"],"de":["Benötigt Nx und pnpm workspaces für die Monorepo-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte","Benötigt ein GitHub-Repository für CI/CD und automatisierte Veröffentlichung"],"pt":["Requer Nx e pnpm workspaces para configuração de monorepo","Limitado a projetos TypeScript, Rust e Python","Necessita de repositório GitHub para CI/CD e publicação automatizada"],"ru":["Требует Nx и pnpm workspaces для настройки monorepo","Ограничен проектами TypeScript, Rust и Python","Требует репозитория GitHub для CI/CD и автоматической публикации"],"ar":["يتطلب Nx و pnpm workspaces لإعداد monorepo","محدود بمشاريع TypeScript و Rust و Python","يحتاج إلى مستودع GitHub من أجل CI/CD والنشر التلقائي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"19f683ff289d374a9384a77673dd57358a4cdaa9da91557848449d00965e2704","qualityScore":54}');
