Fehlern","Generierung von Podcasts, Berichten und Bildungsmaterialien"],"pt":["Geração de podcasts e relatórios","Análise baseada em evidências em tecnologia, saúde, economia e desempenho humano","Utilização de script em Python para geração de prompt","Compatibilidade com fallback manual quando a API do NotebookLM Enterprise não estiver disponível"],"ru":["Генерация подкастов и отчетов","Анализ evidence-based в технологиях, здравоохранении, экономике и человеческом выступлении","Использование скрипта на Python для генерации prmpt","Возможность ручного fallback при недоступности API ИИ Агента NotebookLM Enterprise"],"ar":["إنشاء بودكاستات وتقارير","تحليل الأدلة في التكنولوجيا والصحة والاقتصاد والأداء البشري","استخدام سكريبت بايثون لإنشاء البرومت","التحكم اليدوي في الحالات التي لا تتوفر فيها واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لشركة NotebookLM Enterprise"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use notebooklm-audio","notebooklm-audio manual fallback","notebooklm-audio vs NotebookLM Enterprise API","notebooklm-audio setup guide","notebooklm-audio install","what is notebooklm-audio","notebooklm-audio alternative","notebooklm-audio for research and analysis"],"zh":["NotebookLM Audio","AI 工具","研究和分析","手动回退机制","Python 脚本","CLI 工具","NotebookLM Enterprise API"],"ja":["NotebookLM Audio","AI エージェント","研究と分析","マニュアルフォールバックメカニズム","Python スクリプト","CLI ツール","NotebookLM Enterprise API"],"ko":["NotebookLM Audio","AI 에이전트","연구 및 분석","수동 폴백 메커니즘","Python 스크립트","CLI 도구","NotebookLM Enterprise API"],"es":["notebooklm-audio","herramientas de investigación","análisis basado en evidencia","tecnología","salud","economía","python","script","generación de contenido de audio"],"fr":["notebooklm-audio","outils de recherche","analyse basée sur des preuves","technologie","santé","économie","python","script","génération de contenu audio"],"de":["notebooklm-audio","Forschungstools","evidenzbasierte Analyse","Technologie","Gesundheit","Wirtschaft","python","skript","generierung von audioinhalten"],"pt":["notebooklm-audio","análise baseada em evidências","inteligência artificial","python","fallback manual","API NotebookLM Enterprise","podcasts","relatórios","materiais educacionais"],"ru":["ИИ Агент notebooklm-audio","анализ evidence-based","искусственный интеллект","python","ручной fallback","API ИИ Агента NotebookLM Enterprise","подкасты","отчеты","образовательные материалы"],"ar":["notebooklm-audio","تحليل الأدلة","الذكاء الاصطناعي","بايثون","التحكم اليدوي","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لشركة NotebookLM Enterprise","بودكاستات","تقارير","مواد تعليمية"]}},"owner":"yudame","repo":"research","repoPath":"yudame/research","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.316Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"notebooklm-audio","description":"LEGACY SKILL - Manual NotebookLM web interface workflow. The primary workflow now uses notebooklm-enterprise-api for automated audio generation. Use this skill only when the API is unavailable.","bodyPreview":"# NotebookLM Audio Generation (Manual Fallback)\n\n**Status:** Manual fallback - Use when NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable (no paid subscription)\n- API automation fails and fallback is needed\n- User explicitly requests manual workflow\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Generate the Prompt\n\n**CRITICAL:** Always use the script. Never fabricate or modify the prompt.\n\n```bash\ncd ~/src/research/podcast/tools\npython","body":"# NotebookLM Audio Generation (Manual Fallback)\n\n**Status:** Manual fallback - Use when NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable (no paid subscription)\n- API automation fails and fallback is needed\n- User explicitly requests manual workflow\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Generate the Prompt\n\n**CRITICAL:** Always use the script. Never fabricate or modify the prompt.\n\n```bash\ncd ~/src/research/podcast/tools\npython notebooklm_prompt.py ../episodes/EPISODE_PATH/ --copy\n```\n\nThe script:\n- Auto-detects episode title and series name from content_plan.md\n- Verifies all 5 required files exist\n- Outputs the correct prompt with proper branding\n- Copies to clipboard with `--copy` flag (macOS)\n\n**Required files (5 total):**\n```\nepisode-directory/\n├── research/p1-brief.md      # Research brief\n├── research/p3-briefing.md   # Master briefing\n├── report.md                 # Narrative synthesis\n├── sources.md                # Validated sources\n└── content_plan.md           # Episode structure guide\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Show User the Script Output\n\nRun the script and display its **complete output** to the user. The output includes:\n- Episode and series info (auto-detected)\n- File checklist with status (✓ or ✗ MISSING)\n- The ready-to-paste prompt\n- Settings reminder\n- NotebookLM link\n\nExample output:\n```\n============================================================\nNOTEBOOKLM MANUAL AUDIO GENERATION\n============================================================\n\nEpisode: Strategic Selection\nSeries: Algorithms for Life\nDirectory: ../episodes/algorithms-for-life/ep2-strategic-selection\n\n📁 Files to Upload (5/5 ready):\n  ✓ p1-brief.md\n  ✓ report.md\n  ✓ p3-briefing.md\n  ✓ sources.md\n  ✓ content_plan.md\n\n============================================================\n📋 NOTEBOOKLM PROMPT (copy-paste ready):\n============================================================\n\nCreate a two-host podcast episode on: Strategic Selection from our Algorithms for Life series\n...\n\n============================================================\n\n⚙️  Settings: Format: Deep Dive | Length: Long\n\n🔗 Open: https://notebooklm.google.com/\n\n✓ Prompt copied to clipboard!\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: User Completes Manual Workflow\n\nGuide user through these steps:\n\n1. **Go to** https://notebooklm.google.com/\n2. **Create new notebook**\n3. **Upload all 5 source files** (shown in the checklist)\n4. **Click \"Audio Overview\" → \"Customize\"**\n5. **Paste the prompt** (already on clipboard from `--copy`)\n6. **Settings:** Deep Dive format, Long length\n7. **Generate and download audio** (~10-15 minutes)\n8. **Save audio file** to episode directory\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Process Audio\n\nAfter download, use the `podcast-audio-processing` skill:\n- Convert to mp3 if needed\n- Transcribe with local Whisper\n- Generate chapter markers\n- Embed chapters into mp3\n\n---\n\n## Prompt Template Reference\n\nThe prompt is defined in `podcast/tools/notebooklm_prompt.py` (single source of truth).\n\nKey elements:\n- **References content_plan.md** for structure, hooks, key terms\n- **Brand intro:** \"Welcome to Yuda Me Research from our [Series] series by Valor Engels...\"\n- **Brand outro:** \"research dot yuda dot me - that''s Y-U-D-A dot M-E\"\n- **Style:** Define terms, cite specifics, distinguish correlation/causation\n- **Avoids:** Undefined jargon, fabricated examples, over-hedging\n\n**DO NOT:**\n- Duplicate the template elsewhere\n- Manually substitute placeholders\n- Add episode-specific content arcs (content_plan.md handles this)\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Script shows missing files | Complete earlier phases first |\n| Can''t auto-detect title/series | Use `--title` and `--series` flags |\n| Clipboard copy fails | Manually copy from terminal output |\n| Audio too short | Check all 5 files uploaded, use Long setting |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:48.573Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing manual audio content generation for analysis and development purposes when the NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable.","zh":"适用于需要手动音频内容生成用于分析和开发目的的研究代理，特别是在NotebookLM Enterprise API不可用时。","ja":"NotebookLM Enterprise APIが利用できない場合、分析および開発目的のための手動オーディオコンテンツ生成が必要な研究エージェントに適しています。","ko":"NotebookLM Enterprise API가 사용할 수 없는 경우 분석 및 개발 목적으로 수동 오디오 콘텐츠 생성이 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan generación de contenido de audio manual para análisis y desarrollo cuando la API de NotebookLM Enterprise no está disponible.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin d''une génération de contenu audio manuelle à des fins d''analyse et de développement lorsque l''API NotebookLM Enterprise est indisponible.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die manuelle Audioinhalts-Generierung für Analyse- und Entwicklungs-zwecke benötigen, wenn die NotebookLM Enterprise API nicht verfügbar ist.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de geração manual de conteúdo de áudio para fins de análise e desenvolvimento quando a API NotebookLM Enterprise não está disponível.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-исследователей, которым требуется ручная генерация аудиоконтента для анализа и разработки, когда API NotebookLM Enterprise недоступен.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البحث الذي يحتاج إلى توليد محتوى الصوت يدويًا لغرض التحليل والتطوير عندما تكون واجهة برمجة التطبيقات NotebookLM Enterprise غير متاحة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate audio content using a manual fallback, providing a reliable alternative when the NotebookLM Enterprise API is down, utilizing Python scripting for prompt generation and benefiting from comprehensive content analysis for research and development.","zh":"赋予代理使用手动回退生成音频内容的能力，当NotebookLM Enterprise API关闭时提供可靠的替代方案，利用Python脚本进行提示生成，并从全面内容分析中受益，以用于研究和开发。","ja":"エージェントが手動フォールバックを使用してオーディオコンテンツを生成する機能を提供し、NotebookLM Enterprise APIがダウンした場合に信頼性の高い代替手段を提供し、Pythonスクリプティングを使用したプロンプト生成と、研究および開発のための包括的なコンテンツ分析から利益を得ます。","ko":"에이전트가 수동 폴백을 사용하여 오디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, NotebookLM Enterprise API가 다운된 경우에 신뢰할 수 있는 대체 수단을 제공하며, Python 스크립팅을 사용한 프롬프트 생성과 연구 및 개발을 위한 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석의 이점을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar contenido de audio mediante un sistema de reserva manual, proporcionando una alternativa confiable cuando la API de NotebookLM Enterprise está inactiva, utilizando scripting de Python para la generación de instrucciones y beneficiándose de un análisis de contenido integral para investigación y desarrollo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du contenu audio à l''aide d''une fonction de secours manuelle, offrant une alternative fiable lorsque l''API NotebookLM Enterprise est hors service, en utilisant le scripting Python pour la génération d''invites et en bénéficiant d''une analyse de contenu globale pour la recherche et le développement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Audioinhalte mithilfe eines manuellen Fallbacks zu generieren, bietet eine zuverlässige Alternative, wenn die NotebookLM Enterprise API ausfällt, verwendet Python-Skripting für die Prompt-Generierung und profitiert von einer umfassenden Inhaltsanalyse für Forschung und Entwicklung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar conteúdo de áudio usando um fallback manual, fornecendo uma alternativa confiável quando a API NotebookLM Enterprise está inativa, utilizando script Python para geração de prompts e se beneficiando de uma análise de conteúdo abrangente para pesquisa e desenvolvimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать аудиоконтент с помощью ручного fallback, обеспечивая надежную альтернативу, когда API NotebookLM Enterprise недоступна, используя скрипты Python для генерации запросов и пользуясь всесторонним анализом контента для исследований и разработки.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من توليد محتوى الصوت باستخدام سقوف يدوي، وتوفير بديل موثوق عندما تكون واجهة برمجة التطبيقات NotebookLM Enterprise غير نشطة، واستخدام كتابة البرمجيات Python لتوليد الإشارات و الإستفادة من تحليل المحتوى الشامل لأغراض البحث والتطوير."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating audio content for research analysis","Providing manual fallback for API automation failures","Supporting developers with audio content creation when the NotebookLM Enterprise API is inaccessible"],"zh":["为研究分析生成音频内容","为API自动化失败提供手动回退","在NotebookLM Enterprise API无法访问时支持开发人员创建音频内容"],"ja":["研究分析のためのオーディオコンテンツの生成","API自動化の失敗のための手動フォールバックの提供","NotebookLM Enterprise APIにアクセスできない場合の開発者向けオーディオコンテンツ作成のサポート"],"ko":["연구 분석을 위한 오디오 콘텐츠 생성","API 자동화 실패의 수동 폴백 제공","NotebookLM Enterprise API에 액세스할 수 없는 경우 개발자용 오디오 콘텐츠 생성 지원"],"es":["Generación de contenido de audio para análisis de investigación","Proporcionar una función de reserva manual para fallos de automatización de API","Apoyo a los desarrolladores en la creación de contenido de audio cuando la API de NotebookLM Enterprise es inaccesible"],"fr":["Génération de contenu audio pour l''analyse de recherche","Fournir une fonction de secours manuelle en cas d''échec de l''automatisation de l''API","Soutien aux développeurs dans la création de contenu audio lorsque l''API NotebookLM Enterprise est inaccessible"],"de":["Generierung von Audioinhalten für Forschungsanalyse","Bereitstellung einer manuellen Fallback-Funktion für API-Automatisierungsfehler","Unterstützung von Entwicklern bei der Erstellung von Audioinhalten, wenn die NotebookLM Enterprise API nicht zugänglich ist"],"pt":["Geração de conteúdo de áudio para análise de pesquisa","Fornecimento de fallback manual para falhas de automação de API","Suporte aos desenvolvedores com criação de conteúdo de áudio quando a API NotebookLM Enterprise não está acessível"],"ru":["Генерация аудиоконтента для анализа исследований","Предоставление ручного fallback для сбоев автоматизации API","Поддержка разработчиков при создании аудиоконтента, когда API NotebookLM Enterprise недоступна"],"ar":["توليد محتوى الصوت للتحليل البحثي","توفير سقوف يدوي لفشل آلي في واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم المطورين بخلق محتوى الصوت عندما تكون واجهة برمجة التطبيقات NotebookLM Enterprise غير قابلة للوصول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python scripting knowledge","Manual fallback only, not automated","NotebookLM Enterprise API unavailability required for use"],"zh":["需要Python脚本知识","仅手动回退，不是自动的","需要NotebookLM Enterprise API不可用"],"ja":["Pythonスクリプティングの知識が必要","自動ではなく手動フォールバックのみ","NotebookLM Enterprise APIの利用不可が必要"],"ko":["Python 스크립팅 지식이 필요","자동이 아닌 수동 폴백만","NotebookLM Enterprise API가 사용할 수 없는 것이 필요"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de scripting de Python","Sólo reserva manual, no automática","Se requiere la indisponibilidad de la API de NotebookLM Enterprise para su uso"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en scripting Python","Secours manuel uniquement, pas automatisé","L''indisponibilité de l''API NotebookLM Enterprise est requise pour son utilisation"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Skripting-Kenntnisse","Nur manueller Fallback, nicht automatisiert","Die Nichtverfügbarkeit der NotebookLM Enterprise API ist für die Verwendung erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de script Python","Fallback manual apenas, não automatizado","Requer a indisponibilidade da API NotebookLM Enterprise para uso"],"ru":["Требует знаний скриптов Python","Только ручной fallback, не автоматизированный","Требуется недоступность API NotebookLM Enterprise для использования"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة البرمجة Python","سقوف يدوي فقط، وليس آلي","يتطلب عدم إمكانية الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات NotebookLM Enterprise للاستخدام"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"80e257ce19ead65a2737c354440698259ebf31e2370faadb5dbb91b666955823","qualityScore":54}');
