un ensemble de règles pour les noms de branches et les commits","de":"Git-Standards für Orchestrator: eine Sammlung von Regeln für Branch-Namen und Commits","pt":"O que é Orchestrator Git Standards? É um conjunto de regras para nomes de branches e commits","ru":"Что такое Orchestrator Git Standards? Это набор правил для имен веток и коммитов","ar":"ما هي معايير Git للorchestrator؟ هي مجموعة من القواعد لأسماء الفروع والالتزامات"},"features":{"en":["Enforces conventional branch names, such as feature/user-authentication and fix/login-bug","Supports conventional commits for clean history management","Provides guidelines for organizing Git workflows, including creating branches and making commits","Ensures consistency in Git workflows through standardized naming conventions","Allows for easy identification of branch types, such as feature, fix, chore, and docs","Streamlines Git workflow management through standardized commit messages"],"zh":["标准化的Git分支命名规则","规范化的提交消息格式","清晰的历史记录管理","优化的Git工作流程","提高代码质量和可维护性"],"ja":["標準化されたGitブランチ名ルール","規範化されたコミットメッセージ形式","クリアな履歴管理","最適化されたGitワークフロー","コード品質とメンテナンス性の向上"],"ko":["표준화된 Git 브랜치 이름 규칙","규范화된 커밋 메시지 형식","명확한 기록 관리","최적화된 Git 워크플로우","코드 품질과 유지 보수성 향상"],"es":["Nombres de ramas convencionales (feature, fix, chore, etc.)","Commits limpios y organizados","Historial de Git ordenado","Compatibilidad con flujos de trabajo Git estándar","Mejora de la colaboración en equipo con estándares claros"],"fr":["Noms de branches conventionnels (feature, fix, chore, etc.)","Commits propres et organisés","Historique Git ordonné","Compatibilité avec les workflows Git standard","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe avec des normes claires"],"de":["Konventionelle Branch-Namen (feature, fix, chore usw.)","Saubere und organisierte Commits","Geordneter Git-Verlauf","Kompatibilität mit Standard-Git-Workflows","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit durch klare Standards"],"pt":["Nomens de branches convencionais","Commits convencionais","Histórico de commits limpo","Integração com workflows de Git","Suporte a branches de recursos e correções","Padronização de commits e branches"],"ru":["Конвенциональные имена веток","Конвенциональные коммиты","Чистая история коммитов","Интеграция с рабочими процессами Git","Поддержка веток функций и исправлений","Стандартизация коммитов и веток"],"ar":["أسماء فروع متوافقة","التزامات متوافقة","تاريخ التزامات نظيف","التكامل مع سير عمل Git","دعم فروع الميزات والتصحيحات","توحيد التزامات والفروع"]},"keywords":{"en":["Orchestrator Git Standards setup guide","how to use Orchestrator Git Standards","what is Orchestrator Git Standards","Orchestrator Git Standards vs GitFlow","Orchestrator Git Standards install","Git workflow management best practices","conventional commit messages","branch naming conventions"],"zh":["Orchestrator Git Standards","AIエージェント","Git工作流程","项目管理","代码质量","维护性","Git分支命名","提交消息格式"],"ja":["Orchestrator Git Standards","AIエージェント","Gitワークフロー","プロジェクト管理","コード品質","メンテナンス性","Gitブランチ名","コミットメッセージ形式"],"ko":["Orchestrator Git Standards","AI 에이전트","Git 워크플로우","프로젝트 관리","코드 품질","유지 보수성","Git 브랜치 이름","커밋 메시지 형식"],"es":["estándares git","orchestrator ai","herramientas de desarrollo","git workflow","nombres de ramas convencionales","commits limpios","colaboración en equipo"],"fr":["normes git","orchestrator ai","outils de développement","workflow git","noms de branches conventionnels","commits propres","collaboration d''équipe"],"de":["git-standards","orchestrator ai","entwicklungstools","git-workflow","konventionelle branch-namen","saubere commits","teamzusammenarbeit"],"pt":["orchestrator git standards","git workflow","nomes de branches","commits convencionais","histórico de commits","integração com git","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["orchestrator git standards","git рабочий процесс","имена веток","конвенциональные коммиты","история коммитов","интеграция с git","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","практики разработки"],"ar":["معايير git للorchestrator","سير عمل git","أسماء فروع","التزامات متوافقة","تاريخ التزامات","التكامل مع git","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","ممارسات التطوير"]}},"owner":"GolferGeek","repo":"orchestrator-ai","repoPath":"GolferGeek/orchestrator-ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.317Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Orchestrator Git Standards","description":"Orchestrator AI-specific Git conventions and standards. Branch naming, commit workflow, repository organization. CRITICAL: Follow conventional branch names, use conventional commits, maintain clean git history.","bodyPreview":"# Orchestrator Git Standards Skill\n\n**CRITICAL**: Follow Orchestrator AI Git standards: conventional branch names, conventional commits, clean history.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating branches\n- Making commits\n- Organizing git workflow\n- Following project Git standards\n\n## Branch Naming Standards\n\n### ✅ CORRECT\n\n```bash\nfeature/user-authentication\nfeature/add-api-endpoint\nfix/login-bug\nfix/memory-leak\nchore/update-dependencies\nchore/refactor-service\ndocs/update-readme","body":"# Orchestrator Git Standards Skill\n\n**CRITICAL**: Follow Orchestrator AI Git standards: conventional branch names, conventional commits, clean history.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating branches\n- Making commits\n- Organizing git workflow\n- Following project Git standards\n\n## Branch Naming Standards\n\n### ✅ CORRECT\n\n```bash\nfeature/user-authentication\nfeature/add-api-endpoint\nfix/login-bug\nfix/memory-leak\nchore/update-dependencies\nchore/refactor-service\ndocs/update-readme\ntest/add-unit-tests\nrefactor/auth-service\n```\n\n### ❌ WRONG\n\n```bash\n❌ my-feature\n❌ bugfix\n❌ update\n❌ feature_branch\n❌ FEATURE-BRANCH\n❌ feature/user authentication (spaces)\n```\n\n## Commit Message Standards\n\nSee **Conventional Commits Skill** for complete format. Quick reference:\n\n```bash\n# Format\n<type>(<scope>): <description>\n\n# Examples\nfeat(auth): add user authentication\nfix(api): resolve memory leak\nchore(deps): update dependencies\ndocs(readme): update installation guide\ntest(auth): add unit tests for auth service\nrefactor(api): restructure service layer\n```\n\n## Git Workflow Pattern\n\n### 1. Create Branch\n\n```bash\n# From main\ngit checkout main\ngit pull\n\n# Create feature branch\ngit checkout -b feature/user-authentication\n```\n\n### 2. Make Changes\n\n```bash\n# Edit files\nvim apps/api/src/auth/auth.service.ts\n\n# Stage changes\ngit add .\n\n# Commit with conventional format\ngit commit -m \"feat(auth): add user authentication service\"\n```\n\n### 3. Push and PR\n\n```bash\n# Push branch\ngit push origin feature/user-authentication\n\n# Open PR on GitHub\n# Follow PR process (see GitHub Workflow Skill)\n```\n\n### 4. Update Branch\n\n```bash\n# If main has new commits\ngit checkout main\ngit pull\ngit checkout feature/user-authentication\ngit rebase main  # or git merge main\n```\n\n## Commit Types\n\n| Type | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| `feat` | New feature | `feat(auth): add login` |\n| `fix` | Bug fix | `fix(api): resolve memory leak` |\n| `chore` | Maintenance | `chore(deps): update packages` |\n| `docs` | Documentation | `docs(readme): update install` |\n| `test` | Tests | `test(auth): add unit tests` |\n| `refactor` | Refactoring | `refactor(api): restructure` |\n| `style` | Formatting | `style: format code` |\n| `perf` | Performance | `perf(api): optimize query` |\n\n## Scope Guidelines\n\nScopes should match affected areas:\n\n```bash\n# API scopes\nfeat(api): add endpoint\nfix(api): resolve bug\n\n# Module scopes\nfeat(auth): add authentication\nfix(llm): resolve provider issue\n\n# Feature scopes\nfeat(agents): add new agent type\nfix(webhooks): resolve status tracking\n```\n\n## Git History Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n\n- Keep commits focused (one logical change per commit)\n- Use descriptive commit messages\n- Write clear commit descriptions\n- Rebase before PR (clean history)\n- Squash commits in PR if needed\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n\n- Don''t commit unrelated changes together\n- Don''t use vague commit messages\n- Don''t force push to shared branches\n- Don''t commit broken code\n- Don''t commit secrets or credentials\n\n## Commit Message Examples\n\n### ✅ Good Commit Messages\n\n```bash\nfeat(auth): add JWT token authentication\n\n- Implement JWT token generation\n- Add token validation middleware\n- Update auth service with token logic\n\nfix(api): resolve memory leak in service\n\nThe service was holding references to completed requests.\nNow properly cleans up after request completion.\n\nchore(deps): update NestJS to v10\n\n- Update @nestjs/core to 10.0.0\n- Update @nestjs/common to 10.0.0\n- Resolve breaking changes\n```\n\n### ❌ Bad Commit Messages\n\n```bash\n❌ fix stuff\n❌ update\n❌ changes\n❌ WIP\n❌ asdf\n❌ fixed bug\n```\n\n## Branch Organization\n\n### Main Branches\n\n- `main` - Production-ready code\n- `develop` - Integration branch (if used)\n\n### Feature Branches\n\n```bash\nfeature/<feature-name>\n# Examples:\nfeature/user-authentication\nfeature/add-metrics-dashboard\n```\n\n### Fix Branches\n\n```bash\nfix/<fix-name>\n# Examples:\nfix/login-error\nfix/memory-leak\n```\n\n### Chore Branches\n\n```bash\nchore/<chore-name>\n# Examples:\nchore/update-dependencies\nchore/refactor-service-layer\n```\n\n## Git Commands Reference\n\n### Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Create branch\ngit checkout -b feature/my-feature\n\n# Stage changes\ngit add .\n\n# Commit\ngit commit -m \"feat(module): description\"\n\n# Push\ngit push origin feature/my-feature\n\n# Update from main\ngit checkout main\ngit pull\ngit checkout feature/my-feature\ngit rebase main\n\n# View status\ngit status\n\n# View log\ngit log --oneline\n\n# View changes\ngit diff\n```\n\n## Repository Organization\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n```\norchestrator-ai/\n├── apps/\n│   ├── api/          # NestJS backend\n│   ├── web/          # Vue frontend\n│   └── n8n/          # N8N workflows\n├── storage/          # Database snapshots\n├── scripts/          # Utility scripts\n└── .github/          # GitHub workflows\n```\n\n### Ignore Patterns\n\n`.gitignore` should include:\n- `node_modules/`\n- `.env`\n- `dist/`\n- `*.log`\n- `.DS_Store`\n\n## Checklist for Git Standards\n\nWhen working with Git:\n\n- [ ] Branch name follows convention (`feature/`, `fix/`, etc.)\n- [ ] Commit message follows conventional format\n- [ ] Commit is focused (one logical change)\n- [ ] Commit message is descriptive\n- [ ] No secrets or credentials committed\n- [ ] Code quality gates pass before commit\n- [ ] Git history is clean (rebase if needed)\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- **Conventional Commits**: See Conventional Commits Skill\n- **GitHub Workflow**: See GitHub Workflow Skill\n- **Quality Gates**: See Quality Gates Skill\n- **Worktree Lifecycle**: See Worktree Lifecycle Skill\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:53.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Collaborative Agents needing standardized Git workflows and version control","zh":"适合需要标准化 Git 工作流和版本控制的协作代理","ja":"コラボレーションエージェントが標準化されたGitワークフローとバージョン管理を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"표준화된 Git 워크플로와 버전 관리가 필요한 협업 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes colaborativos que necesitan flujos de trabajo de Git estandarizados y control de versiones","fr":"Parfait pour les agents collaboratifs ayant besoin de flux de travail Git standardisés et de contrôle de version","de":"Perfekt für kollaborative Agenten, die standardisierte Git-Workflows und Versionskontrolle benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Colaborativos que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho Git padronizados e controle de versão","ru":"Идеально для Коллаборативных Агентов, которым необходимы стандартизированные рабочие процессы Git и контроль версий","ar":"مثالي لعميل التعاون الذي يحتاج إلى سير عمل Git стандарدي وควบคول إصدار"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain clean Git histories, utilize conventional branch names, and adhere to commit standards, ensuring seamless project collaboration and integration with tools like GitHub and GitLab","zh":"赋予代理维护干净的Git历史记录、使用约定的分支名称和遵循提交标准的能力，确保项目协作和与GitHub和GitLab等工具的无缝集成","ja":"エージェントにクリーンなGit履歴を維持し、約束されたブランチ名を使用し、コミット標準に従う能力を与え、プロジェクトのコラボレーションとGitHubやGitLabなどのツールとのシームレスな統合を可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 깨끗한 Git 기록을 유지하고 약定的 브랜치 이름을 사용하며 커밋 표준을 따를 수 있도록 해주어 프로젝트 협업과 GitHub 및 GitLab와 같은 도구との 무결점 통합을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener historiales de Git limpios, utilizar nombres de ramas convencionales y cumplir con los estándares de confirmación, lo que garantiza una colaboración de proyecto sin problemas y una integración con herramientas como GitHub y GitLab","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir des historiques Git propres, d''utiliser des noms de branches conventionnels et de respecter les normes de validation, garantissant ainsi une collaboration de projet sans heurts et une intégration avec des outils comme GitHub et GitLab","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, saubere Git-Historien zu pflegen, konventionelle Branch-Namen zu verwenden und Commit-Standards einzuhalten, was eine reibungslose Projektzusammenarbeit und Integration mit Tools wie GitHub und GitLab gewährleistet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter históricos de Git limpos, utilizar nomes de branch convencionais e aderir a padrões de commit, garantindo uma colaboração de projeto sem problemas e integração com ferramentas como GitHub e GitLab","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать чистые истории Git, использовать конвенциональные имена веток и придерживаться стандартов коммитов, обеспечивая бесперебойное сотрудничество проекта и интеграцию с инструментами типа GitHub и GitLab","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على سجلات Git نظيفة، واستخدام أسماء فرع تقليدي و الامتثال لمعايير الالتزام، مما يضمن сотрудنة مشروع بدون مشاكل وتكامل مع أدوات مثل GitHub و GitLab"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating branch creation with conventional naming","Generating commit messages following standard templates","Organizing Git workflows for large-scale projects"],"zh":["使用约定的命名自动创建分支","根据标准模板生成提交消息","组织大型项目的Git工作流"],"ja":["約束された命名で自動的にブランチを作成する","標準テンプレートに従ってコミットメッセージを生成する","大規模なプロジェクトのGitワークフローを整理する"],"ko":["약定的 이름을 사용하여 자동으로 브랜치를 생성","표준 템플릿을 따라 커밋 메시지를 생성","대규모 프로젝트의 Git 워크플로를 구성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de ramas con nombres convencionales","Generación de mensajes de confirmación siguiendo plantillas estándar","Organización de flujos de trabajo de Git para proyectos a gran escala"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de branches avec des noms conventionnels","Génération de messages de validation suivant des modèles standard","Organisation de flux de travail Git pour les projets à grande échelle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Branches mit konventionellen Namen","Generierung von Commit-Nachrichten unter Verwendung standardisierter Vorlagen","Organisation von Git-Workflows für Großprojekte"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de branch com nomenclatura convencional","Gerar mensagens de commit seguindo modelos padrão","Organizar fluxos de trabalho Git para projetos de grande escala"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания веток с конвенциональным именованием","Генерация сообщений коммитов по стандартным шаблонам","Организация рабочих процессов Git для крупномасштабных проектов"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء الفرع بأسماء تقليدي","توليد رسائل الالتزام اتباع القوالب المعيارية","تنظيم سير العمل Git للمشاريع ذات النطاق الواسع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Adherence to predefined branch naming and commit conventions"],"zh":["需要Git安装和配置","遵循预定义的分支命名和提交约定"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","予め定義されたブランチ名とコミット規約に従う"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요","미리 정의된 브랜치 이름 및 커밋 규약을 따름"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Adhesión a las convenciones de nombre de rama y confirmación predefinidas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Respect des conventions de nom de branche et de validation prédéfinies"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Einhaltung der vorgegebenen Branch-Namen- und Commit-Konventionen"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Adesão a convenções de nomenclatura de branch e commit predefinidas"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Соблюдение предопределенных конвенций именования веток и коммитов"],"ar":["يتطلب تركيب وضبط Git","الامتثال لاتفاقيات命名前ية للفرع والالتزام المحددة مسبقا"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"40269499fb6a1da07f2ac38cae56df71b4e2ad19acd90d3603341a7526aa6be4","qualityScore":54}');
