s de aplicaciones móviles son un proceso de verificación de la funcionalidad y el rendimiento de las aplicaciones móviles","fr":"Les tests d''applications mobiles sont un processus de vérification de la fonctionnalité et des performances des applications mobiles","de":"Mobile App-Tests sind ein Verfahren zur Überprüfung der Funktionalität und Leistung mobiler Anwendungen","pt":"Teste de aplicativos móveis é o processo de avaliar a qualidade e o desempenho de um aplicativo móvel","ru":"Тестирование мобильных приложений - это процесс оценки качества и производительности мобильного приложения","ar":"اختبار التطبيقات المحمولة هو عملية تقييم جودة وأداء التطبيق المحمول"},"features":{"en":["Implements unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing for mobile applications","Automates UI testing across iOS and Android using Jest and Detox","Supports performance testing and optimization for mobile apps","Enables integration testing with backend services","Facilitates regression testing before releases"],"zh":["单元测试和UI测试","集成测试和性能测试","React Native测试 vớiJest和Detox","自动化UI测试跨iOS和Android","性能优化和测试"],"ja":["ユニットテストとUIテスト","統合テストとパフォーマンステスト","React Nativeテストwith JestとDetox","自動化UIテストacross iOSとAndroid","パフォーマンス最適化とテスト"],"ko":["단위 테스트와 UI 테스트","통합 테스트와 성능 테스트","React Native 테스트 with Jest와 Detox","자동화 UI 테스트 across iOS와 Android","성능 최적화와 테스트"],"es":["Pruebas unitarias con Jest","Pruebas de interfaz de usuario con Detox","Pruebas de integración con backend services","Pruebas de rendimiento y optimización","Pruebas de regresión antes de lanzamientos"],"fr":["Tests unitaires avec Jest","Tests d''interface utilisateur avec Detox","Tests d''intégration avec des services backend","Tests de performances et d''optimisation","Tests de régression avant les lancements"],"de":["Einheitliche Tests mit Jest","Benutzeroberflächentests mit Detox","IntegrationsTests mit Backend-Diensten","Leistungstests und -optimierung","Rückschrittstests vor Veröffentlichungen"],"pt":["Testes unitários com Jest","Testes de UI com Detox","Testes de integração com backend services","Testes de performance e otimização","Testes de regressão antes de lançamentos"],"ru":["Юнит-тесты с помощью Jest","Тесты UI с помощью Detox","Тесты интеграции с сервисами бэкенда","Тесты производительности и оптимизации","Тесты регрессии перед выпуском"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدة مع Jest","اختبارات واجهة المستخدم مع Detox","اختبارات التكامل مع خدمات الخلفية","اختبارات الأداء والتحسين","اختبارات الانحدار قبل الإصدار"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use mobile-app-testing","what is mobile-app-testing","mobile-app-testing alternative","mobile-app-testing vs Appium","mobile-app-testing install","mobile-app-testing setup guide","Jest and Detox for mobile app testing","automated UI testing for mobile apps","mobile app performance testing best practices"],"zh":["移动应用测试","单元测试","UI测试","集成测试","性能测试","React Native测试","Jest和Detox","自动化UI测试","性能优化"],"ja":["モバイルアプリテスト","ユニットテスト","UIテスト","統合テスト","パフォーマンステスト","React Nativeテスト","JestとDetox","自動化UIテスト","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["모바일 앱 테스팅","단위 테스트","UI 테스트","통합 테스트","성능 테스트","React Native 테스트","Jest와 Detox","자동화 UI 테스트","성능 최적화"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones móviles","React Native","Jest","Detox","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de interfaz de usuario","pruebas de integración","pruebas de rendimiento","optimización de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["tests d''applications mobiles","React Native","Jest","Detox","tests unitaires","tests d''interface utilisateur","tests d''intégration","tests de performances","optimisation d''applications mobiles"],"de":["mobile App-Tests","React Native","Jest","Detox","Einheitliche Tests","Benutzeroberflächentests","IntegrationsTests","Leistungstests","Optimierung mobiler Anwendungen"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos móveis","React Native","Jest","Detox","testes unitários","testes de UI","testes de integração","testes de performance","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["тестирование мобильных приложений","React Native","Jest","Detox","юнит-тесты","тесты UI","тесты интеграции","тесты производительности","разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["اختبار التطبيقات المحمولة","React Native","Jest","Detox","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات واجهة المستخدم","اختبارات التكامل","اختبارات الأداء","تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة"]}},"owner":"DishaAnand","repo":"FocusNest","repoPath":"DishaAnand/FocusNest","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.330Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-app-testing","description":"Comprehensive mobile app testing strategies for iOS and Android. Covers unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, performance testing, and test automation with Detox, Appium, and XCTest.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile App Testing\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement comprehensive testing strategies for mobile applications including unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating reliable mobile applications with test coverage\n- Automating UI testing across iOS and Android\n- Performance testing and optimization\n- Integration testing with backend services\n- Regression testing before releases\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **React Native Testing with Jest & Detox**\n\n```javascr","body":"# Mobile App Testing\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement comprehensive testing strategies for mobile applications including unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating reliable mobile applications with test coverage\n- Automating UI testing across iOS and Android\n- Performance testing and optimization\n- Integration testing with backend services\n- Regression testing before releases\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **React Native Testing with Jest & Detox**\n\n```javascript\n// Unit test with Jest\nimport { calculate } from ''../utils/math'';\n\ndescribe(''Math utilities'', () => {\n  test(''should add two numbers'', () => {\n    expect(calculate.add(2, 3)).toBe(5);\n  });\n\n  test(''should handle negative numbers'', () => {\n    expect(calculate.add(-2, 3)).toBe(1);\n  });\n});\n\n// Component unit test\nimport React from ''react'';\nimport { render, screen } from ''@testing-library/react-native'';\nimport { UserProfile } from ''../components/UserProfile'';\n\ndescribe(''UserProfile Component'', () => {\n  test(''renders user name correctly'', () => {\n    const mockUser = { id: ''1'', name: ''John Doe'', email: ''john@example.com'' };\n    render(<UserProfile user={mockUser} />);\n\n    expect(screen.getByText(''John Doe'')).toBeTruthy();\n  });\n\n  test(''handles missing user gracefully'', () => {\n    render(<UserProfile user={null} />);\n    expect(screen.getByText(/no user data/i)).toBeTruthy();\n  });\n});\n\n// E2E Testing with Detox\ndescribe(''Login Flow E2E Test'', () => {\n  beforeAll(async () => {\n    await device.launchApp();\n  });\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    await device.reloadReactNative();\n  });\n\n  it(''should login successfully with valid credentials'', async () => {\n    await waitFor(element(by.id(''emailInput'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n\n    await element(by.id(''emailInput'')).typeText(''user@example.com'');\n    await element(by.id(''passwordInput'')).typeText(''password123'');\n    await element(by.id(''loginButton'')).multiTap();\n\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Home Feed'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n  });\n\n  it(''should show error with invalid credentials'', async () => {\n    await element(by.id(''emailInput'')).typeText(''invalid@example.com'');\n    await element(by.id(''passwordInput'')).typeText(''wrongpass'');\n    await element(by.id(''loginButton'')).multiTap();\n\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(/invalid credentials/i)))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n  });\n\n  it(''should navigate between tabs'', async () => {\n    await element(by.id(''profileTab'')).tap();\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Profile'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(2000);\n\n    await element(by.id(''homeTab'')).tap();\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Home Feed'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(2000);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### 2. **iOS Testing with XCTest**\n\n```swift\nimport XCTest\n@testable import MyApp\n\nclass UserViewModelTests: XCTestCase {\n  var viewModel: UserViewModel!\n  var mockNetworkService: MockNetworkService!\n\n  override func setUp() {\n    super.setUp()\n    mockNetworkService = MockNetworkService()\n    viewModel = UserViewModel(networkService: mockNetworkService)\n  }\n\n  func testFetchUserSuccess() async {\n    let expectedUser = User(id: UUID(), name: \"John\", email: \"john@example.com\")\n    mockNetworkService.mockUser = expectedUser\n\n    await viewModel.fetchUser(id: expectedUser.id)\n\n    XCTAssertEqual(viewModel.user?.name, \"John\")\n    XCTAssertNil(viewModel.errorMessage)\n    XCTAssertFalse(viewModel.isLoading)\n  }\n\n  func testFetchUserFailure() async {\n    mockNetworkService.shouldFail = true\n\n    await viewModel.fetchUser(id: UUID())\n\n    XCTAssertNil(viewModel.user)\n    XCTAssertNotNil(viewModel.errorMessage)\n    XCTAssertFalse(viewModel.isLoading)\n  }\n}\n\nclass MockNetworkService: NetworkService {\n  var mockUser: User?\n  var shouldFail = false\n\n  override func fetch<T: Decodable>(\n    _: T.Type,\n    from endpoint: String\n  ) async throws -> T {\n    if shouldFail {\n      throw NetworkError.unknown\n    }\n    return mockUser as! T\n  }\n}\n\n// UI Test\nclass LoginUITests: XCTestCase {\n  override func setUp() {\n    super.setUp()\n    continueAfterFailure = false\n    XCUIApplication().launch()\n  }\n\n  func testLoginFlow() {\n    let app = XCUIApplication()\n\n    let emailTextField = app.textFields[\"emailInput\"]\n    let passwordTextField = app.secureTextFields[\"passwordInput\"]\n    let loginButton = app.buttons[\"loginButton\"]\n\n    emailTextField.tap()\n    emailTextField.typeText(\"user@example.com\")\n\n    passwordTextField.tap()\n    passwordTextField.typeText(\"password123\")\n\n    loginButton.tap()\n\n    let homeText = app.staticTexts[\"Home Feed\"]\n    XCTAssertTrue(homeText.waitForExistence(timeout: 5))\n  }\n\n  func testNavigationBetweenTabs() {\n    let app = XCUIApplication()\n    let profileTab = app.tabBars.buttons[\"Profile\"]\n    let homeTab = app.tabBars.buttons[\"Home\"]\n\n    profileTab.tap()\n    XCTAssertTrue(app.staticTexts[\"Profile\"].exists)\n\n    homeTab.tap()\n    XCTAssertTrue(app.staticTexts[\"Home\"].exists)\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. **Android Testing with Espresso**\n\n```kotlin\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass UserViewModelTest {\n  private lateinit var viewModel: UserViewModel\n  private val mockApiService = mock<ApiService>()\n\n  @Before\n  fun setUp() {\n    viewModel = UserViewModel(mockApiService)\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun fetchUserSuccess() = runTest {\n    val expectedUser = User(\"1\", \"John\", \"john@example.com\")\n    `when`(mockApiService.getUser(\"1\")).thenReturn(expectedUser)\n\n    viewModel.fetchUser(\"1\")\n\n    assertEquals(expectedUser.name, viewModel.user.value?.name)\n    assertEquals(null, viewModel.errorMessage.value)\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun fetchUserFailure() = runTest {\n    `when`(mockApiService.getUser(\"1\"))\n      .thenThrow(IOException(\"Network error\"))\n\n    viewModel.fetchUser(\"1\")\n\n    assertEquals(null, viewModel.user.value)\n    assertNotNull(viewModel.errorMessage.value)\n  }\n}\n\n// UI Test with Espresso\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass LoginActivityTest {\n  @get:Rule\n  val activityRule = ActivityScenarioRule(LoginActivity::class.java)\n\n  @Test\n  fun testLoginWithValidCredentials() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.emailInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"user@example.com\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.passwordInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"password123\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.loginButton))\n      .perform(click())\n\n    onView(withText(\"Home\"))\n      .check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun testLoginWithInvalidCredentials() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.emailInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"invalid@example.com\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.passwordInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"wrongpassword\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.loginButton))\n      .perform(click())\n\n    onView(withText(containsString(\"Invalid credentials\")))\n      .check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun testNavigationBetweenTabs() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.profileTab)).perform(click())\n    onView(withText(\"Profile\")).check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.homeTab)).perform(click())\n    onView(withText(\"Home\")).check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **Performance Testing**\n\n```swift\nimport XCTest\n\nclass PerformanceTests: XCTestCase {\n  func testListRenderingPerformance() {\n    let viewModel = ItemsViewModel()\n    viewModel.items = (0..<1000).map { i in\n      Item(id: UUID(), title: \"Item \\(i)\", price: Double(i))\n    }\n\n    measure {\n      _ = viewModel.items.filter { $0.price > 50 }\n    }\n  }\n\n  func testNetworkResponseTime() {\n    let networkService = NetworkService()\n\n    measure {\n      let expectation = XCTestExpectation(description: \"Fetch user\")\n\n      Task {\n        do {\n          _ = try await networkService.fetch(User.self, from: \"/users/test\")\n          expectation.fulfill()\n        } catch {\n          XCTFail(\"Network request failed\")\n        }\n      }\n\n      wait(for: [expectation], timeout: 10)\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n- Write tests for business logic first\n- Use dependency injection for testability\n- Mock external API calls\n- Test both success and failure paths\n- Automate UI testing for critical flows\n- Run tests on real devices\n- Measure performance on target devices\n- Keep tests isolated and independent\n- Use meaningful test names\n- Maintain >80% code coverage\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n- Skip testing UI-critical flows\n- Use hardcoded test data\n- Ignore performance regressions\n- Test implementation details\n- Make tests flaky or unreliable\n- Skip testing on actual devices\n- Ignore accessibility testing\n- Create interdependent tests\n- Test without mocking APIs\n- Deploy untested code\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:12.460Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automated Testing Agents requiring comprehensive mobile application testing capabilities, including unit tests, UI tests, and performance testing.","zh":"适用于需要全面移动应用测试能力的自动化测试代理，包括单元测试、UI 测试和性能测试。","ja":"包括ユニットテスト、UI テスト、パフォーマンス テストを含む包括的なモバイル アプリケーション テスト機能を必要とする自動テスト エージェントに最適です。","ko":"모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 종합적인 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 자동화 테스트 에이전트에 적합하며, 단위 테스트, UI 테스트, 성능 테스트 등을 포함합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Pruebas Automatizadas que requieren capacidades de prueba de aplicaciones móviles integrales, incluyendo pruebas unitarias, pruebas de UI y pruebas de rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Test Automatisés nécessitant des capacités de test d''applications mobiles complètes, y compris des tests unitaires, des tests d''interface utilisateur et des tests de performance.","de":"Ideal für automatisierte Testagenten, die umfassende Mobile-Anwendungstestfunktionen erfordern, einschließlich Einheitstests, UI-Tests und Leistungstests.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Testes Automatizados que exigem capacidades de teste de aplicativos móveis abrangentes, incluindo testes unitários, testes de UI e testes de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизированного тестирования, требующих комплексных возможностей тестирования мобильных приложений, включая модульные тесты, тесты UI и тесты производительности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الاختبار الآلي الذي يتطلب إمكانيات اختبار تطبيق الهاتف المحمول الشامل، بما في ذلك اختبارات الوحدة واختبارات الواجهة واختبارات الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust testing strategies for mobile applications using Jest and Detox, enabling automated UI testing across iOS and Android, performance testing, and integration testing with backend services.","zh":"赋予代理实施使用 Jest 和 Detox 进行移动应用的强大测试策略的能力，实现自动化 UI 测试、跨 iOS 和 Android 的性能测试以及与后端服务的集成测试。","ja":"Jest と Detox を使用してモバイル アプリケーションのロバストなテスト戦略を実装するエージェントの能力を提供し、自動化された UI テスト、iOS と Android 跨りのパフォーマンス テスト、バックエンド サービスとの統合テストを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Jest와 Detox를 사용하여 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 강력한 테스트 전략을 구현하도록 하는데 도움을 주며, 자동화된 UI 테스트, iOS 및 Android를またぐ 성능 테스트, 백엔드 서비스와의 통합 테스트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar estrategias de prueba sólidas para aplicaciones móviles utilizando Jest y Detox, lo que permite pruebas de interfaz de usuario automatizadas en iOS y Android, pruebas de rendimiento y pruebas de integración con servicios de backend.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de test robustes pour les applications mobiles en utilisant Jest et Detox, permettant ainsi des tests d''interface utilisateur automatisés sur iOS et Android, des tests de performance et des tests d''intégration avec les services backend.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste Teststrategien für Mobile-Anwendungen mit Jest und Detox umzusetzen, wodurch automatisierte Benutzeroberflächentests auf iOS und Android, Leistungstests und Integrationstests mit Backendservices ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar estratégias de teste robustas para aplicativos móveis usando Jest e Detox, permitindo testes de UI automatizados em iOS e Android, testes de desempenho e testes de integração com serviços de backend.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать надежные стратегии тестирования для мобильных приложений с использованием Jest и Detox, что позволяет выполнять автоматизированное тестирование UI на iOS и Android, тестирование производительности и интеграционное тестирование с сервисами бэкенда.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ استراتيجيات اختبار قوية لتقديم تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول باستخدام Jest و Detox، وتمكين اختبار الواجهة الآلي عبر نظامي التشغيل iOS و Android، واختبار الأداء، واختبار التكامل مع خدمات الخلفية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI testing for mobile applications","Performing integration testing with backend services","Optimizing mobile application performance","Conducting regression testing before releases"],"zh":["为移动应用自动化 UI 测试","与后端服务进行集成测试","优化移动应用性能","发布前进行回归测试"],"ja":["モバイル アプリケーションの自動化 UI テストの実行","バックエンド サービスとの統合テストの実行","モバイル アプリケーションのパフォーマンス最適化","リリース前の回帰テストの実行"],"ko":["모바일 애플리케이션의 자동화 UI 테스트 수행","백엔드 서비스와의 통합 테스트 수행","모바일 애플리케이션의 성능 최적화","发布 전 회귀 테스트 수행"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de interfaz de usuario para aplicaciones móviles","Realizar pruebas de integración con servicios de backend","Optimizar el rendimiento de las aplicaciones móviles","Realizar pruebas de regresión antes de las versiones"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''interface utilisateur pour les applications mobiles","Effectuer des tests d''intégration avec les services backend","Optimiser les performances des applications mobiles","Effectuer des tests de régression avant les versions"],"de":["Automatisieren von Benutzeroberflächentests für Mobile-Anwendungen","Durchführen von Integrationstests mit Backendservices","Optimieren der Leistung von Mobile-Anwendungen","Durchführen von RegressionsTests vor Versionen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de UI para aplicativos móveis","Realizar testes de integração com serviços de backend","Otimizar o desempenho do aplicativo móvel","Realizar testes de regressão antes dos lançamentos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты UI для мобильных приложений","Проводить тесты интеграции с сервисами бэкенда","Оптимизировать производительность мобильного приложения","Проводить тесты регрессии перед выпусками"],"ar":["تحسين اختبارات الواجهة لبرامج الهاتف المحمول","إجراء اختبارات التكامل مع خدمات الخلفية","تحسين أداء تطبيق الهاتف المحمول","إجراء اختبارات الانحدار قبل الإصدارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native environment","Limited to Jest and Detox testing frameworks"],"zh":["需要 React Native 环境","仅限于 Jest 和 Detox 测试框架"],"ja":["React Native 環境が必要","Jest と Detox のみのテスト フレームワークに限定される"],"ko":["React Native 환경이 필요","Jest와 Detox 테스트 프레임워크만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno React Native","Limitado a los marcos de prueba Jest y Detox"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React Native","Limité aux frameworks de test Jest et Detox"],"de":["Benötigt React Native-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Jest- und Detox-Testframeworks"],"pt":["Exige ambiente React Native","Limitado aos quadros de teste Jest e Detox"],"ru":["Требует среды React Native","Ограничен только фреймворками тестирования Jest и Detox"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React Native","محدود بإطارات الاختبار Jest و Detox"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"656add9094129451d3606c2712db0a052093d74d43053bb4450ba277a39118f7","qualityScore":54}');
