t.","zh":"add-config-field是一种AI工具技能，用于添加和管理.agents.yml配置schema的字段","ja":"add-config-fieldは、.agents.ymlの設定スキーマのフィールドを追加および管理するAIエージェントスキルです","ko":"add-config-field는 .agents.yml 구성 스키마의 필드를 추가 및 관리하는 AI 에이전트 스킬입니다","es":"Add-config-field es una habilidad de agente de IA que agrega campos de configuración con versionado y migración","fr":"Add-config-field est une compétence d''agent d''IA qui ajoute des champs de configuration avec version et migration","de":"Add-config-field ist eine Fähigkeit von KI-Agents, die Konfigurationsfelder mit Versionierung und Migration hinzufügt","pt":"O add-config-field é uma habilidade que estende o esquema de configuração .agents.yml","ru":"Add-config-field — это навык, который расширяет схему конфигурации .agents.yml для ИИ Агентов","ar":"إضافة حقل تكوين هو مهارة توسع مخطط تكوين .agents.yml للوكلاء الذكية"},"features":{"en":["Generates .agents.yml files using 4 YAML templates","Supports versioning through the config-schema-version plugin","Modifies the plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md file","Enables migration support for added config fields","Updates the .agents.yml config schema with new field additions"],"zh":["支持向.agents.yml配置schema添加新字段","提供版本控制和迁移支持","修改plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md文件","更新plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version文件"],"ja":[".agents.ymlの設定スキーマに新しいフィールドを追加する","バージョン管理と移行をサポートする","plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.mdファイルを変更する","plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-versionファイルを更新する"],"ko":[".agents.yml 구성 스키마에 새로운 필드를 추가한다","버전 관리와 마이그레이션을 지원한다","plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md 파일을 수정한다","plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version 파일을 업데이트한다"],"es":["Soporte de versionado para la configuración de agente de IA","Migración de configuración para .agents.yml","Actualización de la configuración de .agents.yml","Uso de YAML para la configuración de agente de IA","Compatibilidad con plugins de majestic-engineer"],"fr":["Prise en charge de la version pour la configuration d''agent d''IA","Migration de configuration pour .agents.yml","Mise à jour de la configuration de .agents.yml","Utilisation de YAML pour la configuration d''agent d''IA","Compatibilité avec les plugins de majestic-engineer"],"de":["Versionierungsunterstützung für die Konfiguration von KI-Agents","Migrationsunterstützung für .agents.yml","Aktualisierung der Konfiguration von .agents.yml","Verwendung von YAML für die Konfiguration von KI-Agents","Kompatibilität mit Plugins von majestic-engineer"],"pt":["Adiciona campos de configuração ao arquivo .agents.yml","Suporte a versionamento e migração","Modifica o arquivo plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md","Atualiza o arquivo plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version"],"ru":["Добавляет поля конфигурации в файл .agents.yml","Поддержка версионирования и миграции","Модифицирует файл plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md","Обновляет файл plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["إضافة حقول تكوين إلى ملف .agents.yml","دعم الإصدار والهجرة","تعدیل ملف plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md","تحديث ملف plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version للوكلاء الذكية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use add-config-field","add-config-field setup guide","add-config-field vs majestic-engineer","add-config-field install","what is add-config-field","add-config-field alternative","YAML config schema setup","AI agent config field management","add-config-field migration support"],"zh":["AI工具","配置schema","add-config-field","版本控制","迁移支持","plugins/majestic-engineer","YAML模板","AIエージェント开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","設定スキーマ","add-config-field","バージョン管理","移行サポート","plugins/majestic-engineer","YAMLテンプレート","AIエージェント開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","구성 스키마","add-config-field","버전 관리","마이그레이션 지원","plugins/majestic-engineer","YAML 템플릿","AI 에이전트 개발"],"es":["agente de IA","configuración de agente de IA","add-config-field","versionado de configuración","migración de configuración","YAML","majestic-engineer","plugins de majestic-engineer"],"fr":["agent d''IA","configuration d''agent d''IA","add-config-field","version de configuration","migration de configuration","YAML","majestic-engineer","plugins de majestic-engineer"],"de":["KI-Agents","Konfiguration von KI-Agents","add-config-field","Versionierung von Konfiguration","Migration von Konfiguration","YAML","majestic-engineer","Plugins von majestic-engineer"],"pt":["add-config-field","configuração .agents.yml","versionamento e migração","plugins majestic engineer","desenvolvimento de habilidades","IoT","Inteligência Artificial"],"ru":["add-config-field","конфигурация .agents.yml","версионирование и миграция","плагины majestic engineer","разработка навыков","ИИ Агенты","Искусственный Интеллект"],"ar":["إضافة حقل تكوين","تكوين .agents.yml","الإصدار والهجرة","ملحقات majestic engineer","تطوير المهارات","الوكلاء الذكية","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Wolverine971","repo":"9takes","repoPath":"Wolverine971/9takes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.339Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-config-field","description":"Add new field to .agents.yml config schema (updates init.md templates, version, migration)","bodyPreview":"# Add Config Field\n\nAdd a new field to the `.agents.yml` config schema with proper versioning and migration support.\n\n## Files Changed\n\n| File                                                   | Purpose                                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md` | 4 YAML templates that generate .agents.yml |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version`","body":"# Add Config Field\n\nAdd a new field to the `.agents.yml` config schema with proper versioning and migration support.\n\n## Files Changed\n\n| File                                                   | Purpose                                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md` | 4 YAML templates that generate .agents.yml |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version`      | Schema version number                      |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/agents/config-reader.md`    | Changelog + migration logic                |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/.claude-plugin/plugin.json` | Plugin version                             |\n| `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`                      | Marketplace version                        |\n\n## Input\n\n- **Field name**: e.g., `auto_commit`\n- **Default value**: e.g., `false` or multi-line YAML\n- **Section**: Where in template (Workflow, Quality Gate, etc.)\n- **Comment**: Inline explanation\n- **Used by**: Agent/command that reads this field\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Update init.md Templates\n\n**File:** `plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md`\n\nAdd field to ALL 4 templates (Rails, Python, Node, Generic). Find the appropriate section and add:\n\n```yaml\nnew_field: value # Comment explaining purpose\n```\n\nOr for multi-line:\n\n```yaml\nnew_field: # Comment\n  - item1\n  - item2\n```\n\n### 2. Bump Schema Version\n\n**File:** `plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version`\n\nIncrement: `1.1` → `1.2`\n\n### 3. Update config-reader.md\n\n**File:** `plugins/majestic-engineer/agents/config-reader.md`\n\n**A) Add to Version Changelog table:**\n\n```markdown\n| 1.2 | `new_field` | Description |\n```\n\n**B) Update migration YAML block** (in \"Outdated config_version\" section):\n\n```yaml\nnew_field: default_value\n```\n\n### 4. Bump Plugin Versions\n\n**Files:**\n\n- `plugins/majestic-engineer/.claude-plugin/plugin.json`: `3.15.0` → `3.16.0`\n- `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`: Update majestic-engineer entry version\n\n### 5. Update Consumer Docs (if needed)\n\nIf a specific agent/command reads this field, update its documentation to mention the config.\n\n## Verification\n\n```bash\n# Count field in init.md (should be 4 - one per template)\ngrep -c \"new_field\" plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md\n\n# Check schema version\ncat plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version\n\n# Check changelog entry\ngrep \"new_field\" plugins/majestic-engineer/agents/config-reader.md\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:24.417Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agent Developers needing flexible configuration management with YAML templates","zh":"非常适合需要利用 YAML 模板进行灵活配置管理的 AI Agent 开发者","ja":"YAML テンプレートを使用した柔軟な構成管理を必要とする AI Agent 開発者に最適","ko":"YAML 템플릿을 통한 유연한 구성 관리가 필요한 AI Agent 개발자에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de Agentes de IA que necesitan una gestión de configuración flexible con plantillas YAML","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs d''agents IA ayant besoin d''une gestion de configuration flexible avec des modèles YAML","de":"Perfekt für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die eine flexible Konfigurationsverwaltung mit YAML-Vorlagen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA que precisam de gerenciamento de configuração flexível com modelos YAML","ru":"Идеально для Разработчиков ИИ-агентов, которым необходим гибкий менеджмент конфигураций с помощью шаблонов YAML","ar":"مثالي لمطوري وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تكوين مرنة باستخدام قوالب YAML"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dynamically extend the .agents.yml config schema with versioning and migration support, leveraging YAML templates for seamless integration with plugins like majestic-engineer","zh":"赋能 Agent 通过版本控制和迁移支持动态扩展 .agents.yml 配置架构，利用 YAML 模板实现与 majestic-engineer 等插件的无缝集成","ja":"バージョン管理と移行サポートにより、エージェントが .agents.yml 構成スキーマを動的に拡張できるようにし、YAML テンプレートを活用して majestic-engineer などのプラグインとのシームレスな統合を実現","ko":"버전 관리 및 마이그레이션 지원을 통해 에이전트가 .agents.yml 구성 스키마를 동적으로 확장할 수 있도록 지원하며, YAML 템플릿을 활용하여 majestic-engineer와 같은 플러그인과의 원활한 통합을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extender dinámicamente el esquema de configuración .agents.yml con soporte de versionado y migración, aprovechando plantillas YAML para una integración sin problemas con plugins como majestic-engineer","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre dynamiquement le schéma de configuration .agents.yml avec une prise en charge de la version et de la migration, en exploitant les modèles YAML pour une intégration transparente avec des plugins comme majestic-engineer","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Konfigurationsschema .agents.yml dynamisch zu erweitern, mit Versionierungs- und Migrationsunterstützung, indem YAML-Vorlagen für eine nahtlose Integration mit Plugins wie majestic-engineer genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender dinamicamente o esquema de configuração .agents.yml com suporte a versionamento e migração, utilizando modelos YAML para integração perfeita com plugins como majestic-engineer","ru":"Позволяет агентам динамически расширять схему конфигурации .agents.yml с поддержкой версионирования и миграции, используя шаблоны YAML для бесшовной интеграции с плагинами như majestic-engineer","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توسيع схема التكوين .agents.yml بشكل ديناميكي مع دعم إصدارات الترقية، باستخدام قوالب YAML من أجل التكامل السلس مع الإضافات مثل majestic-engineer"},"useCases":{"en":["Adding custom fields to agent configurations","Managing versioned config schema updates","Migrating existing configurations to new schema versions"],"zh":["向 Agent 配置添加自定义字段","管理版本化的配置架构更新","将现有配置迁移到新的架构版本"],"ja":["エージェント構成へのカスタムフィールドの追加","バージョン管理された構成スキーマの更新の管理","既存の構成を新しいスキーマバージョンに移行"],"ko":["에이전트 구성에 사용자 정의 필드 추가","버전 관리된 구성 스키마 업데이트 관리","기존 구성을 새로운 스키마 버전으로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Agregar campos personalizados a las configuraciones de los agentes","Gestionar actualizaciones del esquema de configuración con versionado","Migrar configuraciones existentes a nuevas versiones del esquema"],"fr":["Ajouter des champs personnalisés aux configurations des agents","Gérer les mises à jour du schéma de configuration avec versionnage","Migrer les configurations existantes vers de nouvelles versions du schéma"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Felder zu Agentenkonfigurationen hinzufügen","Versionierte Konfigurationsschemas aktualisieren","Vorhandene Konfigurationen auf neue Schemaversionen migrieren"],"pt":["Adicionar campos personalizados às configurações do agente","Gerenciar atualizações do esquema de configuração com versionamento","Migrar configurações existentes para novas versões do esquema"],"ru":["Добавление пользовательских полей в конфигурации агентов","Управление обновлениями схемы конфигурации с версионированием","Миграция существующих конфигураций на новые версии схемы"],"ar":["إضافة حقول مخصصة إلى تكوينات الوكيل","إدارة تحديثات مخطط التكوين مع دعم الإصدارات","نقل التكوينات الحالية إلى إصدارات جديدة من المخطط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to plugins/majestic-engineer directory","Limited to .agents.yml config schema","Versioning and migration support may require additional setup"],"zh":["需要访问 plugins/majestic-engineer 目录","仅限于 .agents.yml 配置架构","版本控制和迁移支持可能需要额外设置"],"ja":["plugins/majestic-engineer ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要",".agents.yml 構成スキーマに限定","バージョン管理と移行のサポートには追加の設定が必要な場合がある"],"ko":["plugins/majestic-engineer 디렉터리에 대한 액세스 필요",".agents.yml 구성 스키마로 제한됨","버전 관리 및 마이그레이션 지원에 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio plugins/majestic-engineer","Limitado al esquema de configuración .agents.yml","El soporte de versionado y migración puede requerir una configuración adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire plugins/majestic-engineer","Limité au schéma de configuration .agents.yml","La prise en charge de la version et de la migration peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis plugins/majestic-engineer","Begrenzt auf das Konfigurationsschema .agents.yml","Die Versionierungs- und Migrationsunterstützung kann eine zusätzliche Einrichtung erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório plugins/majestic-engineer","Limitado ao esquema de configuração .agents.yml","O suporte a versionamento e migração pode exigir configuração adicional"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к директории plugins/majestic-engineer","Ограничен схемой конфигурации .agents.yml","Поддержка версионирования и миграции может потребовать дополнительной настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى دليل الإضافات / majestic-engineer","محدود بمخطط تكوين .agents.yml","دعم إصدارات الترقية قد يتطلب إعدادات إضافية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7b2d1727bd1030544a87fd6485b073936180d9525962c170cfe8a288837c67e3","qualityScore":54}');
