a base de datos","Compatibilidad con daily-api para el desarrollo de aplicaciones","Facilidad de configuración y uso"],"fr":["Accès à la base de données PostgreSQL via Docker","Exécution de requêtes SQL avec psql","Utilisation de conteneurs k8s pour la gestion de la base de données","Compatibilité avec daily-api pour le développement d''applications","Facilité de configuration et d''utilisation"],"de":["Zugriff auf die PostgreSQL-Datenbank über Docker","Ausführung von SQL-Abfragen mit psql","Verwendung von k8s-Containern für die Datenbankverwaltung","Kompatibilität mit daily-api für die Anwendungsentwicklung","Einfache Konfiguration und Bedienung"],"pt":["Acesso ao banco de dados PostgreSQL via Docker","Execução de consultas SQL em contêineres Docker","Gerenciamento de ambientes de desenvolvimento local","Integração com o k8s para contêineres","Suporte a consultas SQL multi-linhas"],"ru":["Доступ к базе данных PostgreSQL через Docker","Выполнение запросов SQL в контейнерах Docker","Управление локальными средами разработки","Интеграция с k8s для контейнеров","Поддержка мульти-строчных запросов SQL"],"ar":["الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL عبر Docker","تنفيذ استفسارات SQL في حاويات Docker","إدارة بيئات التطوير المحلية","التكامل مع k8s للحاويات","دعم استفسارات SQL متعددة الأسطر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use local-env","local-env setup guide","dockerized postgresql","kubernetes local development","local-env alternative","local-env vs docker-compose","install local-env","what is local-env","local-env tutorial"],"zh":["local-env","本地环境管理","PostgreSQL 数据库访问","Docker 容器管理","k8s 容器化","SQL 查询执行","AIエージェント","本地开发环境设置"],"ja":["local-env","ローカル開発環境設定","PostgreSQL データベースへのアクセス","Docker コンテナ管理","k8s コンテナ化","SQL クエリの実行","AIエージェント","ローカル開発環境管理"],"ko":["local-env","로컬 개발 환경 설정","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스에 접근","Docker 컨테이너 관리","k8s 컨테이너화","SQL 쿼리 실행","AI 도구","로컬 개발 환경 관리"],"es":["entorno local","PostgreSQL","Docker","k8s","daily-api","desarrollo de aplicaciones","base de datos","consultas SQL","psql"],"fr":["environnement local","PostgreSQL","Docker","k8s","daily-api","développement d''applications","base de données","requêtes SQL","psql"],"de":["lokale Umgebung","PostgreSQL","Docker","k8s","daily-api","Anwendungsentwicklung","Datenbank","SQL-Abfragen","psql"],"pt":["local-env","gerenciamento de ambientes de desenvolvimento","acesso ao banco de dados PostgreSQL","Docker","k8s","consultas SQL","desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","local-env","управление локальными средами разработки","доступ к базе данных PostgreSQL","Docker","k8s","запросы SQL","локальное развитие"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","local-env","إدارة بيئات التطوير المحلية","الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL","Docker","k8s","استفسارات SQL","التطوير المحلي"]}},"owner":"dailydotdev","repo":"daily-api","repoPath":"dailydotdev/daily-api","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.347Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"local-env","description":"Local environment management - run SQL queries, set up fake payments, reset test data. Use when the user needs help with local database operations or test data setup.","bodyPreview":"# Local Environment Management\n\nHelp with local development environment tasks for daily-api.\n\n## Database Access\n\nPostgreSQL runs locally via Docker in a k8s container.\n\n### Finding the Container\n\n```bash\ndocker ps --format \"table {{.Names}}\" | grep \"k8s_app_postgres\"\n```\n\n### Running Queries\n\n```bash\ndocker exec <CONTAINER_NAME> psql -U postgres -d api -c \"YOUR SQL QUERY\"\n```\n\nFor multi-line queries:\n\n```bash\ndocker exec <CONTAINER_NAME> psql -U postgres -d api <<''EOF''\nSELECT * FROM users LIMIT","body":"# Local Environment Management\n\nHelp with local development environment tasks for daily-api.\n\n## Database Access\n\nPostgreSQL runs locally via Docker in a k8s container.\n\n### Finding the Container\n\n```bash\ndocker ps --format \"table {{.Names}}\" | grep \"k8s_app_postgres\"\n```\n\n### Running Queries\n\n```bash\ndocker exec <CONTAINER_NAME> psql -U postgres -d api -c \"YOUR SQL QUERY\"\n```\n\nFor multi-line queries:\n\n```bash\ndocker exec <CONTAINER_NAME> psql -U postgres -d api <<''EOF''\nSELECT * FROM users LIMIT 1;\nEOF\n```\n\n## Fake Payment Setup\n\nPayment status for opportunities is tracked on the **Organization** level via `recruiterSubscriptionFlags`. Opportunities also store subscription info in their `flags` column.\n\n### Organization Subscription Fields\n\n| Field | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `status` | Must be `''active''` for payment validation to pass |\n| `provider` | Use `''paddle''` |\n| `items[].quantity` | Number of opportunity \"seats\" available |\n| `items[].priceId` | Price ID that opportunities reference |\n\n### Opportunity Flags Fields\n\n| Field | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `plan` | Must match a `priceId` from the org''s subscription items |\n| `batchSize` | Number of candidates per batch |\n\n### Fake Payment for Organization\n\n```sql\nUPDATE organization\nSET \"recruiterSubscriptionFlags\" = jsonb_build_object(\n  ''status'', ''active'',\n  ''provider'', ''paddle'',\n  ''subscriptionId'', ''fake_sub_123'',\n  ''createdAt'', now(),\n  ''updatedAt'', now(),\n  ''items'', jsonb_build_array(\n    jsonb_build_object(''priceId'', ''pri_fake_123'', ''quantity'', 5)\n  )\n)\nWHERE id = ''ORGANIZATION_ID'';\n```\n\nReset: `UPDATE organization SET \"recruiterSubscriptionFlags\" = ''{}'' WHERE id = ''ORGANIZATION_ID'';`\n\n### Fake Payment for Opportunity\n\nRequires updating both the organization AND the opportunity:\n\n```sql\n-- Step 1: Update organization subscription\nUPDATE organization\nSET \"recruiterSubscriptionFlags\" = jsonb_build_object(\n  ''status'', ''active'',\n  ''provider'', ''paddle'',\n  ''subscriptionId'', ''fake_sub_123'',\n  ''createdAt'', now(),\n  ''updatedAt'', now(),\n  ''items'', jsonb_build_array(\n    jsonb_build_object(''priceId'', ''pri_fake_123'', ''quantity'', 5)\n  )\n)\nWHERE id = (SELECT \"organizationId\" FROM opportunity WHERE id = ''OPPORTUNITY_ID'');\n\n-- Step 2: Update opportunity flags\nUPDATE opportunity\nSET flags = flags || jsonb_build_object(\n  ''plan'', ''pri_fake_123'',\n  ''batchSize'', 50\n)\nWHERE id = ''OPPORTUNITY_ID'';\n```\n\nReset:\n```sql\nUPDATE organization SET \"recruiterSubscriptionFlags\" = ''{}''\nWHERE id = (SELECT \"organizationId\" FROM opportunity WHERE id = ''OPPORTUNITY_ID'');\n\nUPDATE opportunity SET flags = flags - ''plan'' - ''batchSize''\nWHERE id = ''OPPORTUNITY_ID'';\n```\n\n## Opportunity State Management\n\nThe `opportunity` table uses a `state` column (integer) to track lifecycle status. Values come from `OpportunityState` enum in `@dailydotdev/schema`.\n\n### OpportunityState Values\n\n| Value | Name | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| 0 | UNSPECIFIED | Default/unset |\n| 1 | DRAFT | Not yet published |\n| 2 | LIVE | Active and visible |\n| 3 | CLOSED | No longer active |\n| 4 | IN_REVIEW | Pending review |\n\n### Update Opportunity State\n\n```sql\n-- Set to LIVE\nUPDATE opportunity SET state = 2 WHERE id = ''OPPORTUNITY_ID'' RETURNING id, state, title;\n\n-- Set to DRAFT\nUPDATE opportunity SET state = 1 WHERE id = ''OPPORTUNITY_ID'' RETURNING id, state, title;\n\n-- Set to CLOSED\nUPDATE opportunity SET state = 3 WHERE id = ''OPPORTUNITY_ID'' RETURNING id, state, title;\n\n-- Set to IN_REVIEW\nUPDATE opportunity SET state = 4 WHERE id = ''OPPORTUNITY_ID'' RETURNING id, state, title;\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen the user asks for local environment help:\n\n1. **For SQL queries**: First find the postgres container, then execute via docker exec\n2. **For fake payments**: Determine if they''re providing an opportunity ID or organization ID, run the appropriate SQL\n3. **Always verify**: After changes, run a SELECT to confirm\n4. **Ask if unclear**: If the request is ambiguous, ask clarifying questions\n\nCommon requests:\n- \"Set up fake payment for opportunity X\" → Run both org and opportunity updates\n- \"Set up fake payment for org X\" → Run only org update\n- \"Run SQL: ...\" → Execute via docker\n- \"Reset payment for X\" → Run reset queries\n- \"Check subscription for X\" → Query and display current state\n- \"Update opp X to live/draft/closed\" → Update opportunity state\n\n## Discovering Schema Information\n\nWhen handling requests not covered in this skill, use these techniques to discover the correct schema:\n\n### 1. Check Entity Definitions\n\nEntity files define column names and types:\n```bash\n# Find the entity file\ngrep -r \"TableName\" src/entity/ --include=\"*.ts\"\n# Read the entity to see column definitions\n```\n\nKey location: `src/entity/` - TypeORM entities with `@Column` decorators show actual DB column names.\n\n### 2. Find Enum Values\n\nMany columns use integer enums from `@dailydotdev/schema`. To find enum values:\n\n```bash\n# Search for enum usage in codebase\ngrep -r \"EnumName\\.\" src/ --include=\"*.ts\" | head -20\n\n# Find enum definition in schema package\ngrep -r \"EnumName\" node_modules/@dailydotdev/schema/dist/ --include=\"*.d.ts\"\n```\n\nCommon enum locations: `node_modules/@dailydotdev/schema/dist/daily-api/*_pb.d.ts`\n\n### 3. Query Existing Data\n\nWhen unsure about column names or values:\n```sql\n-- Check table structure\n\\d tablename\n\n-- See existing values\nSELECT DISTINCT column_name FROM tablename LIMIT 10;\n\n-- Inspect a specific row\nSELECT * FROM tablename WHERE id = ''xxx'' LIMIT 1;\n```\n\n### 4. Common Gotchas\n\n- **Column naming**: Entity property names may differ from DB columns (e.g., `state` not `status`)\n- **Integer enums**: Many \"status\" fields are integers, not strings - find the enum definition\n- **JSONB fields**: Use `jsonb_build_object()` for updates, `->` or `->>` for queries\n- **Quoted columns**: PostgreSQL requires double quotes for camelCase columns (e.g., `\"organizationId\"`)\n\n## Continuous Improvement\n\nThis skill should evolve over time. When you discover new local environment operations, common testing patterns, or useful queries:\n\n1. **Add them to this file** - Update the SKILL.md with new sections or examples\n2. **Keep it practical** - Focus on operations that are frequently needed\n3. **Document the why** - Explain what fields mean and why certain values are used\n\nIf a user asks for something not covered here, help them and then offer to add it to this skill for future use.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:39.351Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Container Management Agents needing streamlined Docker and Kubernetes integration for local development environments.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Docker和Kubernetes集成的容器管理代理，用于本地开发环境。","ja":"コンテナ管理エージェントがローカル開発環境でDockerとKubernetesの統合を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"로컬 개발 환경에서 Docker와 Kubernetes 통합을 간소화해야 하는 컨테이너 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Administración de Contenedores que necesitan una integración de Docker y Kubernetes optimizada para entornos de desarrollo locales.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de gestion de conteneurs nécessitant une intégration de Docker et Kubernetes rationalisée pour les environnements de développement locaux.","de":"Perfekt für Container-Management-Agents, die eine optimierte Docker- und Kubernetes-Integration für lokale Entwicklungsumgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Contêineres que necessitam de integração de Docker e Kubernetes simplificada para ambientes de desenvolvimento local.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления контейнерами, которым требуется упрощенная интеграция Docker и Kubernetes для локальных сред разработки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة الحاويات الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل Docker و Kubernetes المُبسّط لبيئات التطوير المحلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage PostgreSQL database access and execute queries within Docker containers using Kubernetes, streamlining local development environment tasks for daily-api with protocols like Docker exec and psql.","zh":"赋予代理管理PostgreSQL数据库访问权限并在Docker容器中使用Kubernetes执行查询的能力，简化了daily-api的本地开发环境任务，使用的协议如Docker exec和psql。","ja":"エージェントがPostgreSQLデータベースへのアクセスを管理し、Kubernetesを使用してDockerコンテナ内でクエリを実行できるようにし、Docker execやpsqlなどのプロトコルを使用してdaily-apiのローカル開発環境のタスクを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 액세스를 관리하고 Kubernetes를 사용하여 Docker 컨테이너 내에서 쿼리를 실행할 수 있도록 하여 daily-api의 로컬 개발 환경 작업을 Docker exec 및 psql과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar el acceso a la base de datos PostgreSQL y ejecutar consultas dentro de contenedores Docker utilizando Kubernetes, racionalizando las tareas del entorno de desarrollo local para daily-api con protocolos como Docker exec y psql.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''accès à la base de données PostgreSQL et d''exécuter des requêtes à l''intérieur de conteneurs Docker en utilisant Kubernetes, rationalisant les tâches de l''environnement de développement local pour daily-api avec des protocoles tels que Docker exec et psql.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Zugriff auf die PostgreSQL-Datenbank zu verwalten und Abfragen innerhalb von Docker-Containern mithilfe von Kubernetes auszuführen, wodurch Aufgaben in der lokalen Entwicklungsumgebung für daily-api mit Protokollen wie Docker exec und psql rationalisiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o acesso ao banco de dados PostgreSQL e executar consultas dentro de contêineres Docker usando Kubernetes, simplificando tarefas de ambiente de desenvolvimento local para daily-api com protocolos como Docker exec e psql.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять доступом к базе данных PostgreSQL и выполнять запросы внутри контейнеров Docker с помощью Kubernetes, упрощая задачи локальной среды разработки для daily-api с протоколами như Docker exec и psql.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL وتنفيذ الاستفسارات داخل حاويات Docker باستخدام Kubernetes، وبذلك يُبسط مهام بيئة التطوير المحلية ل daily-api مع بروتوكولات مثل Docker exec و psql."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating database query execution","Debugging local PostgreSQL database issues","Managing Kubernetes containerized environments"],"zh":["自动执行数据库查询","调试本地PostgreSQL数据库问题","管理Kubernetes容器化环境"],"ja":["データベースクエリの自動実行","ローカルPostgreSQLデータベースの問題のデバッグ","Kubernetesコンテナ化環境の管理"],"ko":["데이터베이스 쿼리 자동 실행","로컬 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 문제 디버깅","Kubernetes 컨테이너화 환경 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la ejecución de consultas de base de datos","Depuración de problemas de base de datos PostgreSQL locales","Administración de entornos de contenedores de Kubernetes"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''exécution de requêtes de base de données","Débogage des problèmes de base de données PostgreSQL locaux","Gestion d''environnements de conteneurs Kubernetes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ausführung von Datenbankabfragen","Fehlerbehebung bei lokalen PostgreSQL-Datenbankproblemen","Verwaltung von Kubernetes-Containerumgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a execução de consultas de banco de dados","Depurar problemas de banco de dados PostgreSQL local","Gerenciar ambientes contenerizados do Kubernetes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выполнение запросов базы данных","Отлаживать локальные проблемы базы данных PostgreSQL","Управлять контейнерными средами Kubernetes"],"ar":["أتمتة تنفيذ استفسارات قاعدة البيانات","تصحيح أخطاء قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL المحلية","إدارة بيئات حاويات Kubernetes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker and Kubernetes setup","PostgreSQL database only","Local development environment only"],"zh":["需要Docker和Kubernetes设置","仅支持PostgreSQL数据库","仅适用于本地开发环境"],"ja":["DockerとKubernetesの設定が必要","PostgreSQLデータベースのみをサポート","ローカル開発環境のみ"],"ko":["Docker와 Kubernetes 설정이 필요","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스만 지원","로컬 개발 환경만"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Docker y Kubernetes","Solo base de datos PostgreSQL","Solo entorno de desarrollo local"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Docker et Kubernetes","Base de données PostgreSQL uniquement","Environnement de développement local uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Docker- und Kubernetes-Setup","Nur PostgreSQL-Datenbank","Nur lokale Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Docker e Kubernetes","Apenas banco de dados PostgreSQL","Apenas ambiente de desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["Требует настройки Docker и Kubernetes","Только база данных PostgreSQL","Только локальная среда разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Docker و Kubernetes","قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL فقط","بيئة تطوير محلية فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7b4f84344753ae7562bd4fa6465463dbb8663dfb67649c5b6db268c7f652b9f9","qualityScore":54}');
