-env-variable","TypeScript","Hono.js","validation Zod","variables d''environnement","API RESTful","développement d''API","configuration d''environnement"],"de":["add-env-variable","TypeScript","Hono.js","Zod-Validierung","Umgebungsvariablen","RESTful-API","API-Entwicklung","Umgebungskonfiguration"],"pt":["add-env-variable","variáveis de ambiente","validação Zod","TypeScript","Hono.js","APIs RESTful","desenvolvimento de backend","configuração de ambiente"],"ru":["add-env-variable","переменные среды","валидация Zod","TypeScript","Hono.js","RESTful API","разработка бэкенда","настройка среды","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["إضافة متغير البيئة","متغيرات البيئة","التحقق من Zod","TypeScript","Hono.js","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful","تطوير الخادم الخلفي","إعداد البيئة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"madooei","repo":"backend-template","repoPath":"madooei/backend-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.360Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-env-variable","description":"Add a new environment variable to the application. Use when adding configuration for external services, feature flags, or application settings. Triggers on add env, environment variable, config variable.","bodyPreview":"# Add Environment Variable\n\nAdds a new environment variable with Zod validation. All environment variables must be defined in `src/env.ts` and documented in `.env.example`.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify**:\n\n1. `src/env.ts` - Add to schema and mapping\n2. `.env.example` - Document the variable\n3. `tests/env.test.ts` - Add validation tests\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Add to Schema in `src/env.ts`\n\nAdd the variable to the `envSchema` object:\n\n```typescript\nconst envSchema = z.object({\n  /","body":"# Add Environment Variable\n\nAdds a new environment variable with Zod validation. All environment variables must be defined in `src/env.ts` and documented in `.env.example`.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify**:\n\n1. `src/env.ts` - Add to schema and mapping\n2. `.env.example` - Document the variable\n3. `tests/env.test.ts` - Add validation tests\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Add to Schema in `src/env.ts`\n\nAdd the variable to the `envSchema` object:\n\n```typescript\nconst envSchema = z.object({\n  // ... existing variables ...\n\n  // Your new variable (with comment explaining purpose)\n  NEW_VARIABLE: z.string(), // Required string\n  // OR\n  NEW_VARIABLE: z.string().optional(), // Optional string\n  // OR\n  NEW_VARIABLE: z.string().default(\"default-value\"), // With default\n  // OR\n  NEW_VARIABLE: z.coerce.number().default(3000), // Number with coercion\n  // OR\n  NEW_VARIABLE: z.string().url(), // URL validation\n});\n```\n\n### Step 2: Add to Mapping Object\n\nAdd the variable to `mappedEnv` using the `getEnv()` helper (which reads prefixed variables):\n\n```typescript\nconst mappedEnv = {\n  // ... existing mappings ...\n  NEW_VARIABLE: getEnv(\"NEW_VARIABLE\"),\n};\n```\n\n### Step 3: Document in `.env.example`\n\nAdd the variable with a descriptive comment, using the prefix (default: `BT_`):\n\n```bash\n# Description of what this variable is for\nBT_NEW_VARIABLE=example-value\n```\n\n> **Note**: The prefix is defined in `src/env.ts` as `const PREFIX = \"BT\"`. Change this when creating a new service from the template.\n\n### Step 4: Add Tests in `tests/env.test.ts`\n\nAdd test cases for the new variable:\n\n```typescript\nit(\"accepts valid NEW_VARIABLE\", () => {\n  const parsed = envSchema.parse({ NEW_VARIABLE: \"valid-value\" });\n  expect(parsed.NEW_VARIABLE).toBe(\"valid-value\");\n});\n\nit(\"defaults NEW_VARIABLE if missing\", () => {\n  const parsed = envSchema.parse({});\n  expect(parsed.NEW_VARIABLE).toBe(\"default-value\");\n});\n\n// OR for optional\nit(\"accepts missing NEW_VARIABLE\", () => {\n  const parsed = envSchema.parse({});\n  expect(parsed.NEW_VARIABLE).toBeUndefined();\n});\n\n// OR for required\nit(\"rejects missing NEW_VARIABLE\", () => {\n  expect(() => envSchema.parse({})).toThrow();\n});\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\nAll examples use the `getEnv()` helper and `BT_` prefix:\n\n### Required String\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nMY_API_KEY: z.string(),\n\n// Mapping\nMY_API_KEY: getEnv(\"MY_API_KEY\"),\n\n// .env.example\nBT_MY_API_KEY=your-api-key-here\n```\n\n### Optional String\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nOPTIONAL_FEATURE: z.string().optional(),\n\n// Mapping\nOPTIONAL_FEATURE: getEnv(\"OPTIONAL_FEATURE\"),\n\n// .env.example\n# Optional: Enable feature X\n# BT_OPTIONAL_FEATURE=enabled\n```\n\n### String with Default\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nLOG_LEVEL: z.string().default(\"info\"),\n\n// Mapping\nLOG_LEVEL: getEnv(\"LOG_LEVEL\"),\n\n// .env.example\nBT_LOG_LEVEL=info\n```\n\n### Number with Coercion\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nRATE_LIMIT: z.coerce.number().default(100),\n\n// Mapping\nRATE_LIMIT: getEnv(\"RATE_LIMIT\"),\n\n// .env.example\nBT_RATE_LIMIT=100\n```\n\n### URL Validation\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nWEBHOOK_URL: z.string().url().optional(),\n\n// Mapping\nWEBHOOK_URL: getEnv(\"WEBHOOK_URL\"),\n\n// .env.example\n# Webhook endpoint for notifications\nBT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://example.com/webhook\n```\n\n### Enum Values\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nNODE_ENV: z.enum([\"development\", \"test\", \"production\"]).default(\"development\"),\n\n// Mapping\nNODE_ENV: getEnv(\"NODE_ENV\"),\n\n// .env.example\nBT_NODE_ENV=development\n```\n\n### Boolean (as string)\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nENABLE_FEATURE: z.string().transform(v => v === \"true\").default(\"false\"),\n\n// Mapping\nENABLE_FEATURE: getEnv(\"ENABLE_FEATURE\"),\n\n// .env.example\nBT_ENABLE_FEATURE=false\n```\n\n## Usage in Code\n\nAlways import from `@/env`, never use `process.env` directly:\n\n```typescript\nimport { env } from \"@/env\";\n\n// Correct\nconst apiKey = env.MY_API_KEY;\n\n// Wrong - bypasses validation\nconst apiKey = process.env.MY_API_KEY;\n```\n\n## Full Example: Adding Email Service Config\n\n### 1. Update `src/env.ts`\n\n```typescript\nconst envSchema = z.object({\n  // ... existing ...\n\n  // Email service configuration\n  EMAIL_API_KEY: z.string().optional(),\n  EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS: z.string().email().optional(),\n  EMAIL_PROVIDER: z.enum([\"sendgrid\", \"mailgun\"]).default(\"sendgrid\"),\n});\n\nconst mappedEnv = {\n  // ... existing ...\n  EMAIL_API_KEY: getEnv(\"EMAIL_API_KEY\"),\n  EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS: getEnv(\"EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS\"),\n  EMAIL_PROVIDER: getEnv(\"EMAIL_PROVIDER\"),\n};\n```\n\n### 2. Update `.env.example`\n\n```bash\n# Email service configuration\nBT_EMAIL_API_KEY=your-email-api-key\nBT_EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=noreply@example.com\nBT_EMAIL_PROVIDER=sendgrid\n```\n\n### 3. Update `tests/env.test.ts`\n\n```typescript\nit(\"accepts valid email configuration\", () => {\n  const parsed = envSchema.parse({\n    EMAIL_API_KEY: \"test-key\",\n    EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS: \"test@example.com\",\n    EMAIL_PROVIDER: \"mailgun\",\n  });\n  expect(parsed.EMAIL_API_KEY).toBe(\"test-key\");\n  expect(parsed.EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS).toBe(\"test@example.com\");\n  expect(parsed.EMAIL_PROVIDER).toBe(\"mailgun\");\n});\n\nit(\"defaults EMAIL_PROVIDER to sendgrid\", () => {\n  const parsed = envSchema.parse({});\n  expect(parsed.EMAIL_PROVIDER).toBe(\"sendgrid\");\n});\n\nit(\"rejects invalid EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS\", () => {\n  expect(() =>\n    envSchema.parse({ EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS: \"not-an-email\" }),\n  ).toThrow();\n});\n\nit(\"rejects invalid EMAIL_PROVIDER\", () => {\n  expect(() => envSchema.parse({ EMAIL_PROVIDER: \"invalid\" })).toThrow();\n});\n```\n\n## What NOT to Do\n\n- Do NOT use `process.env` directly in application code\n- Do NOT forget to add the mapping in `mappedEnv`\n- Do NOT skip documenting in `.env.example`\n- Do NOT skip adding tests for validation rules\n- Do NOT store secrets in `.env.example` (use placeholder values)\n\n## See Also\n\n- `create-utility-service` - Services that use environment config\n- `test-schema` - Testing Zod schemas (similar patterns)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:11.198Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript and Hono.js Agents requiring efficient environment variable management with Zod validation.","zh":"适用于需要高效环境变量管理和Zod验证的TypeScript和Hono.js代理。","ja":"TypeScriptとHono.jsエージェントで効率的な環境変数管理とZod検証が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 환경 변수 관리와 Zod 검증이 필요한 TypeScript 및 Hono.js 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes TypeScript y Hono.js que requieren una gestión eficiente de variables de entorno con validación Zod.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents TypeScript et Hono.js nécessitant une gestion efficace des variables d''environnement avec validation Zod.","de":"Ideal für TypeScript- und Hono.js-Agents, die eine effiziente Verwaltung von Umgebungsvariablen mit Zod-Validierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agents TypeScript e Hono.js que requerem gerenciamento eficiente de variáveis de ambiente com validação Zod.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов TypeScript и Hono.js, требующих эффективного управления переменными среды с помощью валидации Zod.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء TypeScript و Hono.js الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة فعالة للمتغيرات البيئية مع التحقق من صحة Zod."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely add new environment variables with Zod validation, streamlining backend service configuration and utilizing TypeScript and Hono.js for robust validation and documentation in files like `src/env.ts` and `.env.example`.","zh":"赋予代理安全地添加新的环境变量并利用Zod验证，简化后端服务配置，并使用TypeScript和Hono.js进行强大的验证和文档记录，如在`src/env.ts`和`.env.example`文件中。","ja":"エージェントに新しい環境変数を安全に追加する機能を提供し、Zod検証を使用してバックエンドサービス構成を簡素化し、TypeScriptとHono.jsを使用して強力な検証とドキュメント化を実行できるようにします。たとえば、`src/env.ts`と`.env.example`ファイルで。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 환경 변수를 안전하게 추가하여 Zod 검증을 사용하고, 백엔드 서비스 구성을 간소화하며, TypeScript 및 Hono.js를 사용하여 강력한 검증 및 문서화가 가능하도록 합니다. 예를 들어, `src/env.ts` 및 `.env.example` 파일에서","es":"Habilita a los agentes a agregar nuevas variables de entorno de manera segura con validación Zod, simplificando la configuración del servicio de backend y utilizando TypeScript y Hono.js para una validación y documentación robustas en archivos como `src/env.ts` y `.env.example`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''ajouter de nouvelles variables d''environnement de manière sécurisée avec validation Zod, simplifiant la configuration du service de backend et utilisant TypeScript et Hono.js pour une validation et une documentation robustes dans des fichiers tels que `src/env.ts` et `.env.example`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, neue Umgebungsvariablen sicher mit Zod-Validierung hinzuzufügen, vereinfacht die Konfiguration des Backendservice und nutzt TypeScript und Hono.js für eine robuste Validierung und Dokumentation in Dateien wie `src/env.ts` und `.env.example`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a adicionar novas variáveis de ambiente de forma segura com validação Zod, simplificando a configuração do serviço de backend e utilizando TypeScript e Hono.js para validação robusta e documentação em arquivos como `src/env.ts` e `.env.example`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасно добавлять новые переменные среды с помощью валидации Zod, упрощая конфигурацию бэкенд-сервиса и используя TypeScript и Hono.js для надежной валидации и документации в файлах, таких как `src/env.ts` и `.env.example`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إضافة متغيرات بيئية جديدة بأمان مع التحقق من صحة Zod، وتبسيط cấuته الخدمة الخلفية واستخدام TypeScript و Hono.js للتحقق من الصحة القوي وتوثيق الملفات مثل `src/env.ts` و `.env.example`."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding sensitive variables with Zod validation","Documenting environment variables in `.env.example`","Testing environment variable validation with `tests/env.test.ts`"],"zh":["使用Zod验证添加敏感变量","在`.env.example`中记录环境变量","使用`tests/env.test.ts`测试环境变量验证"],"ja":["Zod検証を使用して機密変数を追加する","`.env.example`に環境変数を文書化する","`tests/env.test.ts`を使用して環境変数検証をテストする"],"ko":["Zod 검증을 사용하여 민감한 변수를 추가하는 것",".env.example`에서 환경 변수를 문서화하는 것","`tests/env.test.ts`를 사용하여 환경 변수 검증을 테스트하는 것"],"es":["Agregar variables sensibles con validación Zod","Documentar variables de entorno en `.env.example`","Probar la validación de variables de entorno con `tests/env.test.ts`"],"fr":["Ajouter des variables sensibles avec validation Zod","Documenter les variables d''environnement dans `.env.example`","Tester la validation des variables d''environnement avec `tests/env.test.ts`"],"de":["Hinzufügen sensitiver Variablen mit Zod-Validierung","Dokumentation von Umgebungsvariablen in `.env.example`","Testen der Validierung von Umgebungsvariablen mit `tests/env.test.ts`"],"pt":["Adicionar variáveis sensíveis com validação Zod","Documentar variáveis de ambiente em `.env.example`","Testar validação de variáveis de ambiente com `tests/env.test.ts`"],"ru":["Добавление敏感ных переменных со валидацией Zod","Документирование переменных среды в `.env.example`","Тестирование валидации переменных среды с помощью `tests/env.test.ts`"],"ar":["إضافة متغيرات حساسة مع التحقق من صحة Zod","توثيق المتغيرات البيئية في `.env.example`","اختبار التحقق من صحة المتغيرات البيئية باستخدام `tests/env.test.ts`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Zod validation library","Limited to TypeScript and Hono.js backend services","Needs manual updates to `src/env.ts` and `.env.example` files"],"zh":["需要Zod验证库","仅限于TypeScript和Hono.js后端服务","需要手动更新`src/env.ts`和`.env.example`文件"],"ja":["Zod検証ライブラリが必要","TypeScriptとHono.jsのバックエンドサービスに限定される","`src/env.ts`と`.env.example`ファイルを手動で更新する必要がある"],"ko":["Zod 검증 라이브러리가 필요합니다.","TypeScript 및 Hono.js 백엔드 서비스로 제한됩니다.","`src/env.ts` 및 `.env.example` 파일을 수동으로 업데이트해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca de validación Zod","Limitado a servicios de backend TypeScript y Hono.js","Requiere actualizaciones manuales de los archivos `src/env.ts` y `.env.example`"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque de validation Zod","Limité aux services de backend TypeScript et Hono.js","Nécessite des mises à jour manuelles des fichiers `src/env.ts` et `.env.example`"],"de":["Benötigt die Zod-Validierungsbibliothek","Begrenzt auf TypeScript- und Hono.js-Backendservices","Benötigt manuelle Updates der Dateien `src/env.ts` und `.env.example`"],"pt":["Requer biblioteca de validação Zod","Limitado a serviços de backend TypeScript e Hono.js","Necessita de atualizações manuais nos arquivos `src/env.ts` e `.env.example`"],"ru":["Требует библиотеки валидации Zod","Ограничен для бэкенд-сервисов TypeScript и Hono.js","Требует ручного обновления файлов `src/env.ts` и `.env.example`"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة التحقق من الصحة Zod","محدود لخدمات الخلفية TypeScript و Hono.js","يحتاج إلى تحديث يدوي للملفات `src/env.ts` و `.env.example`"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"072333f034c735697eb5ef2191ea6bf60353b7d4748d454e2f6f0f18715e3153","qualityScore":54}');
