.","zh":"Entry Point Analyzer是一种工具，用于识别智能合约代码库中的状态更改入口点","ja":"Entry Point Analyzerはスマートコントラクトのコードベース内のステート変更エントリーポイントを特定するツール","ko":"Entry Point Analyzer는 스마트 계약 코드베이스의 상태 변경 입장점을 식별하는 도구","es":"Herramienta AI para identificar puntos de entrada en smart contracts","fr":"Outil IA pour identifier les points d''entrée dans les smart contracts","de":"KI-Tool zum Identifizieren von Eintrittspunkten in Smart Contracts","pt":"O entry-point-analyzer é uma ferramenta de análise de contratos inteligentes que identifica pontos de entrada que alteram o estado.","ru":"ИИ Агент entry-point-analyzer - это инструмент анализа смарт-контрактов, который выявляет точки входа, изменяющие состояние.","ar":"entry-point-analyzer هو أداة تحليل العقود الذكية التي تحدد نقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة."},"features":{"en":["Systematically identifies state-changing entry points in smart contract codebases","Guides security audits to map the attack surface of smart contracts","Analyzes access control patterns across a codebase","Identifies privileged operations and role-restricted functions","Helps build an understanding of which functions can modify contract state"],"zh":["识别状态更改入口点","指导安全审计","分析访问控制模式","识别特权操作和角色限制函数","构建对合约状态修改函数的理解"],"ja":["ステート変更エントリーポイントの識別","セキュリティ監査のガイド","アクセス制御パターンの分析","特権操作と役割制限関数の識別","コントラクト状態変更関数の理解の構築"],"ko":["상태 변경 입장점 식별","보안 감사를 위한 가이드","접근 제어 패턴 분석","특권 연산과 역할 제한 함수 식별","계약 상태 변경 함수에 대한 이해 구축"],"es":["Análisis de puntos de entrada en smart contracts","Identificación de funciones con cambios de estado","Análisis de patrones de control de acceso","Detección de operaciones privilegiadas","Identificación de funciones restringidas por roles"],"fr":["Analyse des points d''entrée dans les smart contracts","Identification des fonctions avec des changements d''état","Analyse des modèles de contrôle d''accès","Détection des opérations privilégiées","Identification des fonctions restreintes par rôles"],"de":["Analyse von Eintrittspunkten in Smart Contracts","Identifizierung von Funktionen mit Zustandsänderungen","Analyse von Zugriffskontrollmustern","Erkennung von privilegierten Operationen","Identifizierung von rollenbeschränkten Funktionen"],"pt":["Identifica pontos de entrada que alteram o estado em contratos inteligentes","Ajuda a guiar auditorias de segurança","Análise de padrões de controle de acesso em todo o código","Identificação de operações privilegiadas e funções restritas por papel","Construção de um entendimento de quais funções podem modificar o contrato"],"ru":["Выявляет точки входа, изменяющие состояние в смарт-контрактах","Помогает руководить проверками безопасности","Анализ паттернов контроля доступа по всему коду","Выявление привилегированных операций и функций, ограниченных по роли","Построение понимания, какие функции могут изменять контракт"],"ar":["تحديد نقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة في العقود الذكية","مساعدة في توجيه عمليات التدقيق الأمني","تحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول في جميع أنحاء الكود","تحديد العمليات المميزة والوظائف المحظورة حسب الدور","بناء فهم للوظائف التي يمكنها تعديل العقد"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use entry-point-analyzer","entry-point-analyzer for smart contract security","entry-point-analyzer alternative tools","entry-point-analyzer setup guide","what is entry-point-analyzer","entry-point-analyzer vs other audit tools","installing entry-point-analyzer","entry-point-analyzer best practices"],"zh":["智能合约安全审计","Entry Point Analyzer","状态更改入口点","访问控制模式","特权操作","角色限制函数","合约状态修改函数","AIエージェント","代码安全"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのセキュリティ監査","Entry Point Analyzer","ステート変更エントリーポイント","アクセス制御パターン","特権操作","役割制限関数","コントラクト状態変更関数","AIエージェント","コードセキュリティ"],"ko":["스마트 계약 보안 감사","Entry Point Analyzer","상태 변경 입장점","접근 제어 패턴","특권 연산","역할 제한 함수","계약 상태 변경 함수","AI 에이전트","코드 보안"],"es":["Entry Point Analyzer","seguridad de smart contracts","análisis de puntos de entrada","control de acceso en smart contracts","auditoría de seguridad","herramientas de seguridad para smart contracts","Entry Point Analyzer en español","AI para seguridad de smart contracts"],"fr":["Entry Point Analyzer","sécurité des smart contracts","analyse des points d''entrée","contrôle d''accès dans les smart contracts","audit de sécurité","outils de sécurité pour les smart contracts","Entry Point Analyzer en français","IA pour la sécurité des smart contracts"],"de":["Entry Point Analyzer","Sicherheit von Smart Contracts","Analyse von Eintrittspunkten","Zugriffskontrolle in Smart Contracts","Sicherheitsaudit","Sicherheitstools für Smart Contracts","Entry Point Analyzer auf Deutsch","KI für die Sicherheit von Smart Contracts"],"pt":["entry-point-analyzer","análise de contratos inteligentes","segurança de contratos","pontos de entrada","auditoria de segurança","controle de acesso","operadores privilegiados"],"ru":["ИИ Агент entry-point-analyzer","анализ смарт-контрактов","безопасность контрактов","точки входа","проверка безопасности","контроль доступа","привилегированные операторы"],"ar":["entry-point-analyzer","تحليل العقود الذكية","أمان العقود","نقاط الدخول","تدقيق الأمن","تحكم الوصول","عمليات مميزة"]}},"owner":"1203992808","repo":"ChatGPTCaricature","repoPath":"1203992808/ChatGPTCaricature","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.361Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"entry-point-analyzer","description":"Analyzes smart contract codebases to identify state-changing entry points for security auditing. Detects externally callable functions that modify state, categorizes them by access level (public, admin, role-restricted, contract-only), and generates structured audit reports. Excludes view/pure/read-only functions. Use when auditing smart contracts (Solidity, Vyper, Solana/Rust, Move, TON, CosmWasm) or when asked to find entry points, audit flows, external functions, access control patterns, or privileged operations.","bodyPreview":"# Entry Point Analyzer\n\nSystematically identify all **state-changing** entry points in a smart contract codebase to guide security audits.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Starting a smart contract security audit to map the attack surface\n- Asked to find entry points, external functions, or audit flows\n- Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase\n- Identifying privileged operations and role-restricted functions\n- Building an understanding of which functions can modify contract st","body":"# Entry Point Analyzer\n\nSystematically identify all **state-changing** entry points in a smart contract codebase to guide security audits.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Starting a smart contract security audit to map the attack surface\n- Asked to find entry points, external functions, or audit flows\n- Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase\n- Identifying privileged operations and role-restricted functions\n- Building an understanding of which functions can modify contract state\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo NOT use this skill for:\n- Vulnerability detection (use audit-context-building or domain-specific-audits)\n- Writing exploit POCs (use solidity-poc-builder)\n- Code quality or gas optimization analysis\n- Non-smart-contract codebases\n- Analyzing read-only functions (this skill excludes them)\n\n## Scope: State-Changing Functions Only\n\nThis skill focuses exclusively on functions that can modify state. **Excluded:**\n\n| Language | Excluded Patterns |\n|----------|-------------------|\n| Solidity | `view`, `pure` functions |\n| Vyper | `@view`, `@pure` functions |\n| Solana | Functions without `mut` account references |\n| Move | Non-entry `public fun` (module-callable only) |\n| TON | `get` methods (FunC), read-only receivers (Tact) |\n| CosmWasm | `query` entry point and its handlers |\n\n**Why exclude read-only functions?** They cannot directly cause loss of funds or state corruption. While they may leak information, the primary audit focus is on functions that can change state.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Detect Language** - Identify contract language(s) from file extensions and syntax\n2. **Use Tooling (if available)** - For Solidity, check if Slither is available and use it\n3. **Locate Contracts** - Find all contract/module files (apply directory filter if specified)\n4. **Extract Entry Points** - Parse each file for externally callable, state-changing functions\n5. **Classify Access** - Categorize each function by access level\n6. **Generate Report** - Output structured markdown report\n\n## Slither Integration (Solidity)\n\nFor Solidity codebases, Slither can automatically extract entry points. Before manual analysis:\n\n### 1. Check if Slither is Available\n\n```bash\nwhich slither\n```\n\n### 2. If Slither is Detected, Run Entry Points Printer\n\n```bash\nslither . --print entry-points\n```\n\nThis outputs a table of all state-changing entry points with:\n- Contract name\n- Function name\n- Visibility\n- Modifiers applied\n\n### 3. Use Slither Output as Foundation\n\n- Parse the Slither output table to populate your analysis\n- Cross-reference with manual inspection for access control classification\n- Slither may miss some patterns (callbacks, dynamic access control)—supplement with manual review\n- If Slither fails (compilation errors, unsupported features), fall back to manual analysis\n\n### 4. When Slither is NOT Available\n\nIf `which slither` returns nothing, proceed with manual analysis using the language-specific reference files.\n\n## Language Detection\n\n| Extension | Language | Reference |\n|-----------|----------|-----------|\n| `.sol` | Solidity | [{baseDir}/references/solidity.md]({baseDir}/references/solidity.md) |\n| `.vy` | Vyper | [{baseDir}/references/vyper.md]({baseDir}/references/vyper.md) |\n| `.rs` + `Cargo.toml` with `solana-program` | Solana (Rust) | [{baseDir}/references/solana.md]({baseDir}/references/solana.md) |\n| `.move` | Move (Aptos/Sui) | [{baseDir}/references/move.md]({baseDir}/references/move.md) |\n| `.fc`, `.func`, `.tact` | TON (FunC/Tact) | [{baseDir}/references/ton.md]({baseDir}/references/ton.md) |\n| `.rs` + `Cargo.toml` with `cosmwasm-std` | CosmWasm | [{baseDir}/references/cosmwasm.md]({baseDir}/references/cosmwasm.md) |\n\nLoad the appropriate reference file(s) based on detected language before analysis.\n\n## Access Classification\n\nClassify each state-changing entry point into one of these categories:\n\n### 1. Public (Unrestricted)\nFunctions callable by anyone without restrictions.\n\n### 2. Role-Restricted\nFunctions limited to specific roles. Common patterns to detect:\n- Explicit role names: `admin`, `owner`, `governance`, `guardian`, `operator`, `manager`, `minter`, `pauser`, `keeper`, `relayer`, `lender`, `borrower`\n- Role-checking patterns: `onlyRole`, `hasRole`, `require(msg.sender == X)`, `assert_owner`, `#[access_control]`\n- When role is ambiguous, flag as **\"Restricted (review required)\"** with the restriction pattern noted\n\n### 3. Contract-Only (Internal Integration Points)\nFunctions callable only by other contracts, not by EOAs. Indicators:\n- Callbacks: `onERC721Received`, `uniswapV3SwapCallback`, `flashLoanCallback`\n- Interface implementations with contract-caller checks\n- Functions that revert if `tx.origin == msg.sender`\n- Cross-contract hooks\n\n## Output Format\n\nGenerate a markdown report with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Entry Point Analysis: [Project Name]\n\n**Analyzed**: [timestamp]\n**Scope**: [directories analyzed or \"full codebase\"]\n**Languages**: [detected languages]\n**Focus**: State-changing functions only (view/pure excluded)\n\n## Summary\n\n| Category | Count |\n|----------|-------|\n| Public (Unrestricted) | X |\n| Role-Restricted | X |\n| Restricted (Review Required) | X |\n| Contract-Only | X |\n| **Total** | **X** |\n\n---\n\n## Public Entry Points (Unrestricted)\n\nState-changing functions callable by anyone—prioritize for attack surface analysis.\n\n| Function | File | Notes |\n|----------|------|-------|\n| `functionName(params)` | `path/to/file.sol:L42` | Brief note if relevant |\n\n---\n\n## Role-Restricted Entry Points\n\n### Admin / Owner\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| `setFee(uint256)` | `Config.sol:L15` | `onlyOwner` |\n\n### Governance\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n\n### Guardian / Pauser\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n\n### Other Roles\n| Function | File | Restriction | Role |\n|----------|------|-------------|------|\n\n---\n\n## Restricted (Review Required)\n\nFunctions with access control patterns that need manual verification.\n\n| Function | File | Pattern | Why Review |\n|----------|------|---------|------------|\n| `execute(bytes)` | `Executor.sol:L88` | `require(trusted[msg.sender])` | Dynamic trust list |\n\n---\n\n## Contract-Only (Internal Integration Points)\n\nFunctions only callable by other contracts—useful for understanding trust boundaries.\n\n| Function | File | Expected Caller |\n|----------|------|-----------------|\n| `onFlashLoan(...)` | `Vault.sol:L200` | Flash loan provider |\n\n---\n\n## Files Analyzed\n\n- `path/to/file1.sol` (X state-changing entry points)\n- `path/to/file2.sol` (X state-changing entry points)\n```\n\n## Filtering\n\nWhen user specifies a directory filter:\n- Only analyze files within that path\n- Note the filter in the report header\n- Example: \"Analyze only `src/core/`\" → scope = `src/core/`\n\n## Analysis Guidelines\n\n1. **Be thorough**: Don''t skip files. Every state-changing externally callable function matters.\n2. **Be conservative**: When uncertain about access level, flag for review rather than miscategorize.\n3. **Skip read-only**: Exclude `view`, `pure`, and equivalent read-only functions.\n4. **Note inheritance**: If a function''s access control comes from a parent contract, note this.\n5. **Track modifiers**: List all access-related modifiers/decorators applied to each function.\n6. **Identify patterns**: Look for common patterns like:\n   - Initializer functions (often unrestricted on first call)\n   - Upgrade functions (high-privilege)\n   - Emergency/pause functions (guardian-level)\n   - Fee/parameter setters (admin-level)\n   - Token transfers and approvals (often public)\n\n## Common Role Patterns by Protocol Type\n\n| Protocol Type | Common Roles |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| DEX | `owner`, `feeManager`, `pairCreator` |\n| Lending | `admin`, `guardian`, `liquidator`, `oracle` |\n| Governance | `proposer`, `executor`, `canceller`, `timelock` |\n| NFT | `minter`, `admin`, `royaltyReceiver` |\n| Bridge | `relayer`, `guardian`, `validator`, `operator` |\n| Vault/Yield | `strategist`, `keeper`, `harvester`, `manager` |\n\n## Rationalizations to Reject\n\nWhen analyzing entry points, reject these shortcuts:\n- \"This function looks standard\" → Still classify it; standard functions can have non-standard access control\n- \"The modifier name is clear\" → Verify the modifier''s actual implementation\n- \"This is obviously admin-only\" → Trace the actual restriction; \"obvious\" assumptions miss subtle bypasses\n- \"I''ll skip the callbacks\" → Callbacks define trust boundaries; always include them\n- \"It doesn''t modify much state\" → Any state change can be exploited; include all non-view functions\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf a file cannot be parsed:\n1. Note it in the report under \"Analysis Warnings\"\n2. Continue with remaining files\n3. Suggest manual review for unparsable files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:13.939Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Smart Contract Agents needing advanced security audit capabilities and state-changing entry point analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要高级安全审计功能和状态更改入口点分析的智能合约代理。","ja":"高度なセキュリティ監査機能と状態変更エントリポイント分析が必要なスマートコントラクトエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 보안 감사 기능 및 상태 변경 엔트리 포인트 분석이 필요한 스마트 계약 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de contrato inteligente que necesitan capacidades de auditoría de seguridad avanzadas y análisis de puntos de entrada que cambian el estado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contrat intelligent nécessitant des capacités d''audit de sécurité avancées et d''analyse de points d''entrée modifiant l''état.","de":"Perfekt für Smart-Contract-Agents, die erweiterte Sicherheitsauditfunktionen und Analyse von Zustandsänderungseintrittspunkten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Contrato Inteligente que precisam de capacidades avançadas de auditoria de segurança e análise de pontos de entrada que alteram o estado.","ru":"Идеально для агентов умных контрактов, требующих передовых возможностей аудита безопасности и анализа точек входа, изменяющих состояние.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء العقدين الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى khảيات متقدمة لتدقيق الأمن وتحليل نقاط الدخول التي تتغير الحالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically identify state-changing entry points in smart contract codebases, guiding security audits with access control pattern analysis and privileged operation identification using Solidity and Ethereum protocols.","zh":"赋予代理系统atically识别智能合约代码库中的状态更改入口点的能力，使用Solidity和Ethereum协议来指导安全审计，包括访问控制模式分析和特权操作识别。","ja":"スマートコントラクトコードベース内の状態変更エントリポイントを体系的に識別するエージェントの能力を提供し、SolidityとEthereumのプロトコルを使用して、セキュリティ監査をアクセス制御パターン分析および特権操作識別でガイドします。","ko":"스마트 계약 코드베이스 내의 상태 변경 엔트리 포인트를 체계적으로 식별할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여 Solidity 및 Ethereum 프로토콜을 사용하여 보안 감사를 액세스 제어 패턴 분석 및 특권 연산 식별로 안내합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar sistemáticamente los puntos de entrada que cambian el estado en las bases de código de contrato inteligente, guiando las auditorías de seguridad con análisis de patrones de control de acceso e identificación de operaciones privilegiadas utilizando Solidity y protocolos de Ethereum.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier systématiquement les points d''entrée modifiant l''état dans les bases de code de contrat intelligent, en guidant les audits de sécurité avec l''analyse de modèles de contrôle d''accès et l''identification d''opérations privilégiées en utilisant Solidity et les protocoles Ethereum.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Zustandsänderungseintrittspunkte in Smart-Contract-Codebasen systematisch zu identifizieren, indem sie Sicherheitsaudits mit Zugriffskontrollmusteranalyse und Identifizierung privilegierter Operationen unter Verwendung von Solidity und Ethereum-Protokollen leiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar sistematicamente os pontos de entrada que alteram o estado no código de contratos inteligentes, orientando auditorias de segurança com análise de padrões de controle de acesso e identificação de operações privilegiadas usando Solidity e protocolos Ethereum.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически определять точки входа, изменяющие состояние, в кодовой базе умных контрактов, руководя аудитами безопасности с помощью анализа шаблонов контроля доступа и определения привилегированных операций с использованием Solidity и протоколов Ethereum.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديد نقاط الدخول التي تتغير الحالة في قواعد بيانات العقود الذكية بشكل منهجي، وتوجيه التدقيقات الأمنية باستخدام تحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول وتحديد العمليات المميزة باستخدام Solidity وبروتوكولات Ethereum."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating smart contract security audits to map attack surfaces","Identifying external functions and audit flows in Solidity code","Analyzing access control patterns and role-restricted functions in Ethereum smart contracts"],"zh":["自动化智能合约安全审计以映射攻击面","识别Solidity代码中的外部函数和审计流程","分析Ethereum智能合约中的访问控制模式和角色限制函数"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのセキュリティ監査を自動化して攻撃面をマッピングする","Solidityコード内の外部関数と監査フローを識別する","Ethereumスマートコントラクト内のアクセス制御パターンと役割制限関数を分析する"],"ko":["스마트 계약 보안 감사를 자동화하여 공격 표면을 매핑합니다","Solidity 코드 내의 외부 함수 및 감사 흐름을 식별합니다","Ethereum 스마트 계약 내의 액세스 제어 패턴 및 역할 제한 함수를 분석합니다"],"es":["Automatización de auditorías de seguridad de contrato inteligente para mapear superficies de ataque","Identificación de funciones externas y flujos de auditoría en código Solidity","Análisis de patrones de control de acceso y funciones restringidas por roles en contratos inteligentes de Ethereum"],"fr":["Automation des audits de sécurité de contrat intelligent pour cartographier les surfaces d''attaque","Identification des fonctions externes et des flux d''audit dans le code Solidity","Analyse des modèles de contrôle d''accès et des fonctions restreintes par rôle dans les contrats intelligents Ethereum"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheitsaudits für Smart-Contracts, um Angriffsflächen zu kartieren","Identifizierung externer Funktionen und Audit-Flows in Solidity-Code","Analyse von Zugriffskontrollmustern und rollenbeschränkten Funktionen in Ethereum-Smart-Contracts"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de segurança de contratos inteligentes para mapear superfícies de ataque","Identificar funções externas e fluxos de auditoria em código Solidity","Analizar padrões de controle de acesso e funções restritas por papel em contratos inteligentes Ethereum"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты безопасности умных контрактов для картирования поверхностей атаки","Определить внешние функции и потоки аудита в коде Solidity","Анализировать шаблоны контроля доступа и функции с ограниченным доступом в умных контрактах Ethereum"],"ar":["تحسين تدقيق أمن العقود الذكية تلقائيًا لتحديد سطوح الهجوم","تحديد الدوال الخارجية وتدفق التدقيق في رمز Solidity","تحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول والدوال المقيدة بالدور في العقود الذكية Ethereum"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to smart contract codebase","Limited to Ethereum-based smart contracts","Needs expertise in Solidity and smart contract security"],"zh":["需要访问智能合约代码库","仅限于Ethereum基智能合约","需要Solidity和智能合约安全方面的专业知识"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Ethereumベースのスマートコントラクトのみ","Solidityおよびスマートコントラクトセキュリティに関する専門知識が必要"],"ko":["스마트 계약 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","이더리움 기반 스마트 계약만 해당됩니다","Solidity 및 스마트 계약 보안에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código del contrato inteligente","Limitado a contratos inteligentes basados en Ethereum","Necesita experiencia en Solidity y seguridad de contrato inteligente"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code du contrat intelligent","Limité aux contrats intelligents basés sur Ethereum","Nécessite une expertise en Solidity et en sécurité de contrat intelligent"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis des Smart-Contracts","Begrenzt auf Ethereum-basierte Smart-Contracts","Benötigt Expertenwissen in Solidity und Smart-Contract-Sicherheit"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código do contrato inteligente","Limitado a contratos inteligentes baseados em Ethereum","Necessita de conhecimento especializado em Solidity e segurança de contratos inteligentes"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе умного контракта","Ограничен умными контрактами на основе Ethereum","Требуется специализированное знание Solidity и безопасности умных контрактов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات العقد الذكي","محدود بالعقود الذكية المبنية على Ethereum","يتطلب معرفة متخصصة في Solidity وأمن العقود الذكية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"30ee63ad5132dbfd760a86d0b5e626299c297100bc6d2fc7ca0a93ce037cbb02","qualityScore":54}');
