INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('1203992808/ChatGPTCaricature/entry-point-analyzer', 'entry-point-analyzer', '1203992808', 'ChatGPTCaricature', 'community', 'entry-point-analyzer 1203992808 ChatGPTCaricature community The entry-point-analyzer skill systematically identifies all state-changing entry points in a smart contract codebase, guiding security audits for developers and auditors. Entry Point Analyzer是识别智能合约代码库中状态更改入口点的工具，用于指导安全审计和访问控制 Entry Point Analyzerはスマートコントラクトのコードベース内のステート変更エントリーポイントを特定するツールで、セキュリティ監査とアクセス制御を支援 Entry Point Analyzer는 스마트 계약 코드베이스의 상태 변경 입장점을 식별하는 도구로 보안 감사를 안내합니다 Entry Point Analyzer identifica puntos de entrada en smart contracts para auditar la seguridad. Analiza patrones de control de acceso y opera Entry Point Analyzer identifie les points d''entrée dans les smart contracts pour auditer la sécurité. Analyse les modèles de contrôle d''accès et opère Entry Point Analyzer identifiziert Eintrittspunkte in Smart Contracts, um die Sicherheit zu überprüfen. Analysiert Zugriffskontrollmuster und operiert O entry-point-analyzer é uma ferramenta para identificar pontos de entrada que alteram o estado em contratos inteligentes, ajudando a guiar auditorias de segurança. ИИ Агент entry-point-analyzer - это инструмент для выявления точек входа, изменяющих состояние в смарт-контрактах, что помогает руководить проверками безопасности. entry-point-analyzer هو أداة لتحديد نقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة في العقود الذكية، مما يساعد في توجيه عمليات التدقيق الأمني. how to use entry-point-analyzer entry-point-analyzer for smart contract security entry-point-analyzer alternative tools entry-point-analyzer setup guide what is entry-point-analyzer entry-point-analyzer vs other audit tools installing entry-point-analyzer entry-point-analyzer best practices 智能合约安全审计 Entry Point Analyzer 状态更改入口点 访问控制模式 特权操作 角色限制函数 合约状态修改函数 AIエージェント 代码安全 Systematically identifies state-changing entry points in smart contract codebases Guides security audits to map the attack surface of smart contracts Analyzes access control patterns across a codebase Identifies privileged operations and role-restricted functions Helps build an understanding of which functions can modify contract state entry-point-analyzer is a skill that analyzes smart contract codebases to identify state-changing entry points, facilitating security audits and access control pattern analysis.');
