INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('NagasakaH/dev-process/investigation', 'investigation', 'NagasakaH', 'dev-process', 'community', 'investigation NagasakaH dev-process community The investigation skill automates detailed analysis of target repositories, generating comprehensive documentation from project.yaml inputs, benefiting developers and project managers. Investigation技能是AIエージェント的一项功能，用于项目调査和文档化，通过project.yaml文件进行配置 調査スキルはAIエージェントの機能の1つで、プロジェクトの調査と文書化に使用され、project.yamlファイルで設定します Investigation 기능은 AI 에이전트의 기능 중 하나로, 프로젝트를 조사하고 문서화하는 데 사용되며, project.yaml 파일로 설정할 수 있습니다 El skill de investigación permite a los desarrolladores realizar una investigación detallada de los repositorios y tickets, utilizando project.yaml como fuente de verdad única Le skill d''investigation permet aux développeurs de réaliser une investigation détaillée des répertoires et des tickets, en utilisant project.yaml comme source de vérité unique Das Untersuchungsskill ermöglicht es Entwicklern, eine detaillierte Untersuchung von Repositorien und Tickets durchzuführen, wobei project.yaml als einzige Wahrheitsquelle verwendet wird A investigação em desenvolvimento de software é um processo crucial que envolve a definição de metas e a criação de artefatos. Nossa solução utiliza project.yaml e setup.yaml para simplificar esse processo. Расследование в разработке программного обеспечения - это важный процесс, который включает определение целей и создание артефактов. Наше решение использует project.yaml и setup.yaml для упрощения этого процесса. التحقيق في تطوير البرمجيات هو عملية حاسمة تتضمن تعريف الأهداف وإنشاء مكونات. حلنا يستخدم project.yaml و setup.yaml لتبسيط هذه العملية. how to use investigation skill what is investigation in AI agents investigation setup guide project.yaml configuration for investigation automated repository analysis tools investigation vs manual analysis investigation skill for developers AI agent investigation documentation getting started with investigation skill AIエージェント Investigation技能 project.yaml 详细调査 文档化 UML图 开发效率 项目管理 Utilizes project.yaml as Single Source of Truth (SSOT) for all processes Extracts repository and ticket information from project.yaml meta and setup sections References setup.description.background for investigation context Outputs detailed investigation results to docs/{target_repo}/investigation/ directory Includes UML diagrams in investigation results Investigation is a skill that systematically analyzes target repositories, defining processes and creating documentation based on project.yaml configurations.');
